ings on the upper floor. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(9923,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/architecture/interior-courtyard-perspective-showi_5w0T002.jpg','Interior courtyard perspective showing the levels of the building alongside metal railings and other structural elements. (Source: CKA Archives)','Interior courtyard perspective showing the levels of the building alongside metal railings and other structural elements. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(9925,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/architecture/the-roofing-structure-of-the-residen_dgitXFV.jpg','The roofing structure of the residential space. (Source: CKA Archives)','The roofing structure of the residential space. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(9926,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/architecture/the-roofing-is-covered-with-metal-sh_uTP0NPG.jpg','The roofing is covered with metal sheets and mangalore tiles. (Source: CKA Archives)','The roofing is covered with metal sheets and mangalore tiles. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(9928,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/architecture/a-simple-metal-bridge-connecting-are_w7orlrL.jpg','A simple metal bridge connecting areas on the first floor. (Source: CKA Archives)','A simple metal bridge connecting areas on the first floor. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(9930,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/architecture/the-sealed-entrance-to-the-undergrou_eXainPX.jpg','The sealed entrance to the underground tunnel (Balad), a historical security feature found in many homes of this area. (Source: CKA Archives)','The sealed entrance to the underground tunnel (Balad), a historical security feature found in many homes of this area. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(9933,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/architecture/the-devashish-bungalow-which-lies-on_CZyGE22.jpg','The Devashish Bungalow which lies on the Gulmohar Road of Savedi. (Source: CKA Archives)','The Devashish Bungalow which lies on the Gulmohar Road of Savedi. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(9935,'culture/im