 CKA Archives)','An interpretive panel showcasing the tumultuous political history of the Ahmednagar fort in Bhingar.  (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(10063,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/cultural-sites/the-surroundings-of-the-ahmednagar_3TCZetY.jpg','The surroundings of the Ahmednagar fort at Bhingar. (Source: CKA Archives)','The surroundings of the Ahmednagar fort at Bhingar. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(10069,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/cultural-sites/the-arch-in-the-area-which-is-dubb_os249JP.jpg','The arch in the area which is dubbed as the Zulta Pul or the ‘hanging bridge.’ at the Ahmednagar fort. (Source: CKA Archives)','The arch in the area which is dubbed as the Zulta Pul or the ‘hanging bridge.’ at the Ahmednagar fort. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(10070,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/cultural-sites/a-front-view-of-the-zulta-pul-noti_BMlXC7b.jpg','A front view of the Zulta Pul. Notice the chains that lead from the arch to a place that lies outside the Ahmednagar fort’s stone fortification. (Source: CKA Archives)','A front view of the Zulta Pul. Notice the chains that lead from the arch to a place that lies outside the Ahmednagar fort’s stone fortification. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(10072,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/cultural-sites/the-leaders-block-at-the-ahmednaga_eCN8wbe.jpg','The Leader’s Block at the Ahmednagar fort, where national leaders who played a pivotal role in India’s freedom struggle were detained. (Source: CKA Archives)','The Leader’s Block at the Ahmednagar fort, where national leaders who played a pivotal role in India’s freedom struggle were detained. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(10073,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/cultural-sites/an-interpretive-board-at-the-leade_uEhScS9.jpg','An interpretive board at the Leader’s Block outlines its historical significance and the national leaders who were imprisoned here.(Source: CKA Archives)','An interpretive board at the Leader’s Block outlines its his