. (Source: CKA Archives)','The Shiv Mandir at Vriddheshwar, Ahilyanagar. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(10161,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/cultural-sites/evening-view-of-the-datta-mandir-i_Nh1BDwz.jpg','Evening view of the Datta Mandir in Savedi, Ahilyanagar. (Source: CKA Archives)','Evening view of the Datta Mandir in Savedi, Ahilyanagar. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(10163,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/cultural-sites/stone-carving-of-bhagwan-krishna-l_dp0WX1g.jpg','Stone carving of Bhagwan Krishna lifting the Govardhan Parvat on his finger at the Datta Mandir, Savedi. (Source: CKA Archives)','Stone carving of Bhagwan Krishna lifting the Govardhan Parvat on his finger at the Datta Mandir, Savedi. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(10164,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/cultural-sites/a-carving-of-a-scene-from-the-rama_nF6bi8J.jpg','A carving of a scene from the Ramayan at the Datta Mandir, Savedi. (Source: CKA Archives)','A carving of a scene from the Ramayan at the Datta Mandir, Savedi. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(10167,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/cultural-sites/the-sai-baba-samadhi-mandir-at-shi_quC3qNT.png','The Sai Baba Samadhi Mandir at Shirdi, Ahilyanagar.[6]','The Sai Baba Samadhi Mandir at Shirdi, Ahilyanagar.[6]','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sai_Baba_of_Shirdi'),(10171,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/cultural-sites/an-image-of-sai-baba7-24906268.png','An image of Sai Baba.[7]','An image of Sai Baba.[7]','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sai_Baba_of_Shirdi'),(10175,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/cultural-sites/the-siddhivinayak-mandir-at-siddha_uMPx6PE.png','The Siddhivinayak Mandir at Siddhatek, Ahilyanagar. (Source: CKA Archives)','The Siddhivinayak Mandir at Siddhatek, Ahilyanagar. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(10179,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/cultural-sites/the-exterior-of-the-vishal-ganpati_MqB0sOO.jpg','The exterior of the Vishal Ganpati Mandir of Ahilyanagar. Notice the traditional Maratha a