arashtra/ahilyanagar/markets/glimpses-from-mangalvar-bazaar-april-2024_rBKwdfp.jpg','Glimpses from Mangalvar Bazaar, April 2024.  (Source: CKA Archives)','Glimpses from Mangalvar Bazaar, April 2024.  (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10299,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/markets/onion-sellers-at-the-shivkrupa-trading-co_7JAi45q.jpg','Onion Sellers at the Shivkrupa Trading Company in Parner  (Source: CKA Archives)','Onion Sellers at the Shivkrupa Trading Company in Parner  (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10310,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/markets/a-shop-selling-trinkets-at-shirdi-market-_QFT5B9A.jpg','A shop selling trinkets at Shirdi market  (Source: CKA Archives)','A shop selling trinkets at Shirdi market  (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10313,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/markets/rahata-market-in-sakori-rahata-source-cka_r2LJVE5.jpg','Rahata Market in Sakori, Rahata  (Source: CKA Archives)','Rahata Market in Sakori, Rahata  (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10320,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/sports-games/bailgada-sharyat1-7f355a58.jpg','Bailgada Sharyat[1]','Bailgada Sharyat[1]','https://images.app.goo.gl/nR7dRCY1LWZx9th27'),(10323,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/sports-games/champul-is-a-strategic-board-game-fo_B0tQmbQ.jpg','Champul is a strategic board game for two to four players where the goal is to race coins to the center of a 5x5 board. Players roll four cowrie shells to determine movement, blending chance and strategy as they choose which of their four coins to move. While historically popular as Champulyain rural areas, it has been largely replaced by Ludo (Source: CKA Archives).','Champul is a strategic board game for two to four players where the goal is to race coins to the center of a 5x5 board. Players roll four cowrie shells to determine movement, blending chance and strategy as they choose which of their four coins to move. While historically popular as Champulyain rural areas, it has been largely replaced by Ludo (Source: CKA Archives).',''),(10327,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/sports-games/narayan-gawadi-vastads-ganpatichi-ra_9DjypI8.jpg','Narayan Gawadi Vastad\'s Ganpatichi Rajwadi Talim, Maliwada (Source: CKA Archives).','Narayan Gawadi Vastad\'s Ganpatichi Rajwadi Talim, Maliwada (Source: CKA Archives).',''),(10328,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/sports-games/kauthichi-talim-tukaram-patvekar-vas_BK4Hs7w.jpg','Kauthichi Talim (Tukaram Patvekar Vastad Talim),  Maliwada (Source: CKA Archives).','Kauthichi Talim (Tukaram Patvekar Vastad Talim),  Maliwada (Source: CKA Archives).',''),(10329,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/sports-games/the-indoor-area-of-kauthichi-talim-m_ItBcGZe.jpg','The indoor area of Kauthichi Talim, Maliwada (Source: CKA Archives).','The indoor area of Kauthichi Talim, Maliwada (Source: CKA Archives).',''),(10330,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/sports-games/chhaburao-landge-source-cka-archives_AJUyQmV.jpg','Chhaburao Landge (Source: CKA Archives).','Chhaburao Landge (Source: CKA Archives).',''),(10339,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/sports-games/bhagyashree-hanumant-fand-source-cka_Qi5CDot.jpg','Bhagyashree Hanumant Fand (Source: CKA Archives).','Bhagyashree Hanumant Fand (Source: CKA Archives).',''),(10341,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/sports-games/zaheer-khan-born-on-october-7-1978-i_xkn3pGx.jpg','Zaheer Khan, born on October 7, 1978, in Shrirampur, Ahilyanagar, is a distinguished former Indian cricketer who represented the national team across all formats from 2000 to 2014.[2]','Zaheer Khan, born on October 7, 1978, in Shrirampur, Ahilyanagar, is a distinguished former Indian cricketer who represented the national team across all formats from 2000 to 2014.[2]','https://www.indiatvnews.com/sports/cricket/full-text-zaheer-khan-retirement-speech-18275.html'),(10343,'culture/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/sports-games/pankaj-shirsat-served-as-the-captain_Eoguqaf.jpg','Pankaj Shirsat served as the ca