hat wind through the residential area. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10817,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/another-view-of-the-narrow-lanes-that-w_J5HQoV8.jpg','Another view of the narrow lanes that wind through the residential area. (Source: CKA Archives)','Another view of the narrow lanes that wind through the residential area. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10819,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/the-main-gate-at-the-entrance-of-the-pr_OqBxSz4.jpg','The main gate at the entrance of the property. (Source: CKA Archives)','The main gate at the entrance of the property. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10820,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/the-smaller-doors-within-the-interiors-_1A6F3kM.jpg','The smaller doors within the interiors of the house. (Source: CKA Archives)','The smaller doors within the interiors of the house. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10822,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/the-entrances-composite-structure-appea_OC6L7BT.jpg','The entrance’s composite structure appears to incorporate layered brickwork techniques, with what seems to be intentional color coding on the arches and a distinctive diamond-shaped pattern carved at the entrance. The modest spacing between stone-laden steps might suggest the artisans’ consideration for the aged. (Source: CKA Archives)','The entrance’s composite structure appears to incorporate layered brickwork techniques, with what seems to be intentional color coding on the arches and a distinctive diamond-shaped pattern carved at the entrance. The modest spacing between stone-laden steps might suggest the artisans’ consideration for the aged. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10823,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/the-wooden-materials-used-within-the-in_mMYdfMn.jpg','The wooden materials used within the interiors. Notice the unique pilaster designs - the details are something that can rarely be seen in contemporary architecture. (Source: CKA Archives)','The wooden materials used within the interiors. Notice the unique pilaster designs - the details are something that can rarely be seen in contemporary architecture. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10825,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/the-exterior-features-a-neutral-color-p_YzGshy0.jpg','The exterior features a neutral color palette. (Source: CKA Archives)','The exterior features a neutral color palette. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10826,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/in-contrast-to-the-exterior-the-interio_YoaJcNx.jpg','In contrast to the exterior, the interior of the residence is painted in vibrant colours. (Source: CKA Archives)','In contrast to the exterior, the interior of the residence is painted in vibrant colours. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10828,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/the-double-doors-with-their-borders-tri_YnZtWqh.jpg','The double doors, with their borders, trims, and central divider, set the tone for the house\'s architectural character. (Source: CKA Archives)','The double doors, with their borders, trims, and central divider, set the tone for the house\'s architectural character. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10830,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/additional-exterior-doors-reflect-a-ble_MqqvM36.jpg','Additional exterior doors reflect a blend of geometric and leaf motifs, with variations in design—one door is more ornate with an arch. (Source: CKA Archives)','Additional exterior doors reflect a blend of geometric and leaf motifs, with variations in design—one door is more ornate with an arch. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10831,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/the-others-remain-comparatively-more-si_la05QPJ.jpg','The others remain comparatively more simple in their design. (Source: CKA Archives)','The others remain comparatively more simple in their design. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10833,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architectur