: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10840,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/stones-are-used-as-stoppers-for-the-win_OYKd0Sn.jpg','Stones are used as stoppers for the window doors. The lower positioning of the window suggests it may have been designed for improved ventilation. (Source: CKA Archives)','Stones are used as stoppers for the window doors. The lower positioning of the window suggests it may have been designed for improved ventilation. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10841,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/some-windows-are-enhanced-with-intricat_nGUhb0o.jpg','Some windows are enhanced with intricate designs, adding a unique touch to the space. (Source: CKA Archives)','Some windows are enhanced with intricate designs, adding a unique touch to the space. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10842,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/the-metal-railings-possibly-added-durin_JrGDHil.jpg','The metal railings, possibly added during renovations, provide both security and a functional design element. (Source: CKA Archives)','The metal railings, possibly added during renovations, provide both security and a functional design element. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10844,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/munim-ji-chi-peti-storage-chest-traditi_0EnT4Tf.jpg','Munim ji chi peti - storage chest traditionally used for keeping valuables and essential household items. (Source: CKA Archives)','Munim ji chi peti - storage chest traditionally used for keeping valuables and essential household items. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10845,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/takhatposh-a-traditional-wooden-bed-onc_9PBn6cg.jpg','Takhatposh – A traditional wooden bed, once common, now a reminder of earlier days. (Source: CKA Archives)','Takhatposh – A traditional wooden bed, once common, now a reminder of earlier days. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10847,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/the-foldable-baithak-als