ngement of curved tiles. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10908,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/close-up-view-of-the-layered-arrangemen_y2zfWOc.jpg','Close-up view of the layered arrangement of Mangalore tiles forming the clay tile roof. (Source: CKA Archives)','Close-up view of the layered arrangement of Mangalore tiles forming the clay tile roof. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10910,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/exposed-wooden-rafters-and-battens-supp_1IFApbg.jpg','Exposed wooden rafters and battens supporting the roofing material, showing the traditional triangular roof framework against turquoise painted walls. (Source: CKA Archives)','Exposed wooden rafters and battens supporting the roofing material, showing the traditional triangular roof framework against turquoise painted walls. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10911,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/interior-view-showing-exposed-wooden-be_HRSbSzS.jpg','Interior view showing exposed wooden beams that support the ceiling. (Source: CKA Archives)','Interior view showing exposed wooden beams that support the ceiling. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10914,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/the-street-character-of-the-settlement-_6QkVIMD.jpg','The street character of the settlement - it is surrounded by traditional and cement structures. (Source: CKA Archives)','The street character of the settlement - it is surrounded by traditional and cement structures. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10915,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/a-narrower-unpaved-lane-showing-signs-o_gTMvUC3.jpg','A narrower unpaved lane showing signs of recent construction or demolition work, with debris on one side. (Source: CKA Archives)','A narrower unpaved lane showing signs of recent construction or demolition work, with debris on one side. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(10917,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/architecture/the-house-nestled-in-the-midst-of-the-