)','An interior passage which showcases the Datta Mandir’s maze-like architectural design. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(11015,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/cultural-sites/devi-mandir-situated-among-the-rock-f_kVkHN1v.jpg','Devi mandir situated among the rock formations at the summit of Devi Point. (Source: CKA Archives)','Devi mandir situated among the rock formations at the summit of Devi Point. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(11016,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/cultural-sites/scenic-hill-landscape-along-the-route_JZ4p9Np.jpg','Scenic hill landscape along the route leading to Devi Point. (Source: CKA Archives)','Scenic hill landscape along the route leading to Devi Point. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(11018,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/cultural-sites/the-mandir-structure-nestled-under-ro_sm1MvRF.jpg','The mandir structure nestled under rock formations at Devi Point. (Source: CKA Archives)','The mandir structure nestled under rock formations at Devi Point. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(11019,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/cultural-sites/a-vast-open-ground-around-devi-point-_gvrrAy8.jpg','A vast open ground around Devi Point, where melas are held. (Source: CKA Archives)','A vast open ground around Devi Point, where melas are held. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(11023,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/cultural-sites/a-panoramic-view-of-gavilgarh-fort-pe_4uXbrwL.jpg','A panoramic view of Gavilgarh Fort, perched atop a hill which is situated near the Melghat Tiger Reserve. (Source: CKA Archives)','A panoramic view of Gavilgarh Fort, perched atop a hill which is situated near the Melghat Tiger Reserve. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(11027,'culture/images/maharashtra/amravati/cultural-sites/exteriors-of-the-hauz-katora-showcasi_13NWHTv.jpg','Exteriors of the Hauz Katora, showcasing its grand octagonal architecture. (Source: CKA Archives)','Exteriors of the Hauz Katora, showcasing its grand octagonal architecture. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(11028,'c