r Cafe[8]','MTDC Crater Cafe[8]','https://r1imghtlak.mmtcdn.com/5d364e6c-89c7-42df-a98d-dd8ca6a81cda.png'),(12119,'culture/images/maharashtra/buldhana/food/mtdc-crater-cafe8-5c6ee045.png','MTDC Crater Cafe[8]','MTDC Crater Cafe[8]','https://r1imghtlak.mmtcdn.com/5d364e6c-89c7-42df-a98d-dd8ca6a81cda.png'),(12148,'culture/images/maharashtra/buldhana/markets/transactions-are-based-on-direct-negotiation_5t85UIq.png','Transactions are based on direct negotiation, with prices determined by factors such as the animal\'s breed, age, physical strength, and health. Buyers often inspect animals closely, sometimes using informal methods to assess their condition and suitability for farm work. Bargaining is done face-to-face, typically in cash, and relies heavily on personal experience and trust rather than formal weighing systems or documentation. The market also serves as a social meeting point, where rural communities exchange farming tips, local news, and maintain long-standing relationships. This system reflects the deep-rooted agricultural traditions of the region, where livestock is still central to daily life and farming practices, especially in areas where mechanization is limited.[1]','Transactions are based on direct negotiation, with prices determined by factors such as the animal\'s breed, age, physical strength, and health. Buyers often inspect animals closely, sometimes using informal methods to assess their condition and suitability for farm work. Bargaining is done face-to-face, typically in cash, and relies heavily on personal experience and trust rather than formal weighing systems or documentation. The market also serves as a social meeting point, where rural communities exchange farming tips, local news, and maintain long-standing relationships. This system reflects the deep-rooted agricultural traditions of the region, where livestock is still central to daily life and farming practices, especially in areas where mechanization is limited.[1]','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=itfB6B619NA&pp=0gcJCfwAo7VqN5tD'),(12150,'culture/images/maharashtra/buldhana/markets/the-thursday-cloth-market-guruwar-kapda-baza_WwsJHUd.png','The Thursday Cloth Market (Guruwar Kapda Bazar) in Khamgaon, held weekly at Tilak Maidan, features numerous stalls selling sarees, dresses, shirts, children’s clothing, schoolwear, and fabrics at affordable prices. Buyers shop for everyday wear, bargain over prices, and pay mostly in cash. The market is known for its wide variety, low prices, and consistent local turnout.[2]','The Thursday Cloth Market (Guruwar Kapda Bazar) in Khamgaon, held weekly at Tilak Maidan, features numerous stalls selling sarees, dresses, shirts, children’s clothing, schoolwear, and fabrics at affordable prices. Buyers shop for everyday wear, bargain over prices, and pay mostly in cash. The market is known for its wide variety, low prices, and consistent local turnout.[2]','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e1Jy_ROJRjQ'),(12168,'culture/images/maharashtra/buldhana/sports-games/prathamesh-samadhan-jawkar-is-a-promine_2pVenOK.png','Prathamesh Samadhan Jawkar is a prominent Indian archer hailing from Buldhana, Maharashtra. Born on March 23, 2004, he began his archery journey at the age of twelve and has quickly risen to become one of the leading figures in the sport. His breakthrough year was 2023, during which he achieved remarkable success on both national and international stages.[1]','Prathamesh Samadhan Jawkar is a prominent Indian archer hailing from Buldhana, Maharashtra. Born on March 23, 2004, he began his archery journey at the age of twelve and has quickly risen to become one of the leading figures in the sport. His breakthrough year was 2023, during which he achieved remarkable success on both national and international stages.[1]','https://www.sportstiger.com/news/who-is-prathamesh-jawkar-second-indian-male-athlete-to-win-silver-at-archery-world-cup'),(12172,'culture/images/maharashtra/buldhana/sports-games/in-addition-to-his-recent-success-at-th_jdwI0Fb.png','In addition to his recent success at the SAAF Championships, Nayan has also participated in other competitions, including the West Zone National Junior Athletics Championship, where he has shown consistent improvement and competitiveness.[2]','In addition to his recent success at the SAAF Championships, Nayan has also participated in other competitions, including the West Zone National Junior Athletics Championship, where he has shown consistent improvement and competitiveness.[2]','https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/city/nagpur/nagpur-athlete-nayan-sarde-to-represent-india-at-under-20-world-athletics-championships/articleshow/112598339.cms'),(12188,'culture/images/maharashtra/buldhana/stories/jijabai-and-young-chhatrapati-shivaji1-c7c11af6.png','Jijabai and young Chhatrapati Shivaji[1]','Jijabai and young Chhatrapati Shivaji[1]','https://i0.wp.com/myvoice.opindia.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2023/01/codevs-05-bal-shivaji-with-jijabai.jpg?resize=696%2C696&ssl=1'),(12191,'culture/images/maharashtra/buldhana/stories/lonar-lake2-829d5e89.png','Lonar Lake[2]','Lonar Lake[2]','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lonar'),(12207,'culture/images/maharashtra/buldhana/stories/gurudwara-kadamsar-sahib-source-cka-archives_qJ0pqZ0.jpg','Gurudwara Kadamsar Sahib (Source: CKA archives)','Gurudwara Kadamsar Sahib (Source: CKA archives)',''),(12212,'culture/images/maharashtra/buldhana/stories/gajanan-maharaj3-592f533d.png','Gajanan Maharaj[3]','Gajanan Maharaj[3]','https://www.google.co.in/url?sa=i&url=https%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FGajanan_Maharaj&psig=AOvVaw3m62rMavrOa4D9eNVo1yQI&ust=1724385841925000&source=images&cd=vfe&opi=89978449&ved=0CBQQjRxqFwoTCLDTxoHch4gDFQAAAAAdAAAAABAE'),(12230,'culture/images/maharashtra/chandrapur/architecture/entrance-to-the-vijjasan-buddhist-cav_HLFnyeR.jpg','Entrance to the Vijjasan Buddhist Caves, with carved passageways and remnants of early Buddhist relief work.[1]','Entrance to the Vijjasan Buddhist Caves, with carved passageways and remnants of early Buddhist relief work.[1]',''),(12234,'culture/images/maharashtra/chandrapur/architecture/remnants-of-the-bhadravati-fort-commo_dpvLly7.jpg','Remnants of the Bhadravati Fort, commonly associated with the Gond rulers.[2]','Remnants of the Bhadravati Fort, commonly associated with the Gond rulers.[2]',''),(12238,'culture/images/maharashtra/chandrapur/architecture/the-parshwanath-mandir-in-bhadravati-_As4R8ss.jpg','The Parshwanath Mandir in Bhadravati, showcasing detailed carvings and sculptural elements characteristic of Jain mandir architecture. (Source: CKA Archives)','The Parshwanath Mandir in Bhadravati, showcasing detailed carvings and sculptural elements characteristic of Jain mandir architecture. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(12242,'culture/images/maharashtra/chandrapur/architecture/shivling-surrounded-by-carved-pillars_rw9NFOC.png','Shivling surrounded by carved pillars in front of the Chandika Devi Mandir.[3]','Shivling surrounded by carved pillars in front of the Chandika Devi Mandir.[3]',''),(12253,'culture/images/maharashtra/chandrapur/artforms/artists-performing-the-dandar-a-performan_H9KfFZy.jpg','Artists performing the Dandar, a performance artform in Chandrapur.[1]','Artists performing the Dandar, a performance artform in Chandrapur.[1]','https://youtu.be/T364FMZCNfU?si=--gM-hgqAhQiVfIc'),(12257,'culture/images/maharashtra/chandrapur/artforms/a-gond-painting-illustrating-traditional-_1oiFrkU.jpg','A Gond painting illustrating traditional motifs inspired by nature by artist Dhawat Singh.[2]','A Gond painting illustrating traditional motifs inspired by nature by artist Dhawat Singh.[2]','https://salesbetov.best/product_details/29097612.html'),(12264,'culture/images/maharashtra/chandrapur/artforms/a-performance-being-staged-during-a-manda_eEstZ06.png','A performance being staged during a Mandai.[3]','A performance being staged during a Mandai.[3]','https://www.esakal.com/vidarbha/coronas-savat-mandai-fest