nt Vachnalay in Chhatrapati Sambhaji Nagar city[6]','Balwant Vachnalay in Chhatrapati Sambhaji Nagar city[6]','https://www.lokmat.com/chhatrapati-sambhajinagar/centenary-balwant-library-which-began-promotion-marathi-nizam-era/'),(12611,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/cultural-sites/the-older-building-_VjCx4Yz.jpg','The older building of the Library[7]','The older building of the Library[7]','https://www.lokmat.com/chhatrapati-sambhajinagar/centenary-balwant-library-which-began-promotion-marathi-nizam-era/'),(12613,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/cultural-sites/bibi-ka-maqbara-als_AdsupEN.jpg','Bibi Ka Maqbara, also known as the Taj of Deccan  in the Begumpura, Chhatrapati Sambhaji Nagar.[8]','Bibi Ka Maqbara, also known as the Taj of Deccan  in the Begumpura, Chhatrapati Sambhaji Nagar.[8]','https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bibi_ka_Maqbara.JPG'),(12615,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/cultural-sites/interiors-of-the-to_2PswZyW.jpg','Interiors of the Tomb[9]','Interiors of the Tomb[9]','https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b6/Mosque_Bibi_ka_Maqbara.jpg/640px-Mosque_Bibi_ka_Maqbara.jpg'),(12618,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/cultural-sites/bhadra-maruti-mandi_4O6p8Kt.jpg','Bhadra Maruti Mandir in Khuldabad[10]','Bhadra Maruti Mandir in Khuldabad[10]','https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bhadra_Maruti_Temple.jpg'),(12621,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/cultural-sites/the-devgiri-fort-in_61p5Ffd.jpg','The Devgiri Fort in Chhatrapati Sambhaji Nagar City.[11]','The Devgiri Fort in Chhatrapati Sambhaji Nagar City.[11]','https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Daulatabad_Fort_1,_Aurangabad,_India.jpg'),(12624,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/cultural-sites/the-ellora-caves-in_TtfhHq8.jpg','The Ellora Caves in Khuldabad Taluka, Chhatrapati Sambhaji Nagar[12]','The Ellora Caves in Khuldabad Taluka, Chhatrapati Sa