 in Paithan.[19]','Sant Eknath Samadhi Mandir in Paithan.[19]','https://santeknath.org/english/samadhi-mandir.html'),(12662,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/festivals-fairs/live-performances-_heP1hzj.png','Live performances during Ellora Ajanta International Festival in 2023[1]','Live performances during Ellora Ajanta International Festival in 2023[1]','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IFsalabn-0k'),(12665,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/festivals-fairs/crowd-admiring-a-d_8CrRlG3.png','Crowd admiring a decorated bull during Sagar Festival celebrations[2]','Crowd admiring a decorated bull during Sagar Festival celebrations[2]','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jAu2eh5-Huw'),(12670,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/festivals-fairs/mask-stall-at-the-_KZN79Qh.png','Mask stall at the Karnapur Jatra[3]','Mask stall at the Karnapur Jatra[3]','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1WBmS7F1GoM'),(12671,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/festivals-fairs/bhavani-mata-mandi_3krmbWu.png','Bhavani Mata Mandir, Karnapur[4]','Bhavani Mata Mandir, Karnapur[4]','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1WBmS7F1GoM'),(12676,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/festivals-fairs/khuldabad-urus-202_aoFF0Cj.png','Khuldabad Urus, 2022[5]','Khuldabad Urus, 2022[5]','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vs-wclW3IHQ'),(12715,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/food/naan-qualia1-4c78c9d3.png','Naan-Qualia[1]','Naan-Qualia[1]','https://recipes.timesofindia.com/articles/features/naan-khaliya-aurangabads-historic-dish/articleshow/46714106.cms'),(12718,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/food/tara-paan-centre2-e44afb9e.jpg','Tara Paan Centre[2]','Tara Paan Centre[2]','https://www.justdial.com/Aurangabad-Maharashtra/Paan-Shops/nct-11271038'),(12720,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/food/tara-paan-centre2-bd972ac9.png','Tara Paan Centre[2]','Tara Paan Centre[2]','https://www.justdial.com/Aurangabad-Maharashtra/Paan-Shops/nct-11271038'),(12721,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/food/paanoffered-at-taara-paan-cen_k0AEshW.png','Paanoffered at Taara Paan Centre[3]','Paanoffered at Taara Paan Centre[3]','https://yourstory.com/smbstory/aurangabad-tara-pan-centre-entrepreneur-7mhhpjz5x2'),(12724,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/food/bhoj-thali-source-cka-archive_eeHRzQP.png','Bhoj Thali (Source: CKA Archives)','Bhoj Thali (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(12727,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/food/barkat-tea-house-source-cka-a_3YnGWSm.png','Barkat Tea House (Source: CKA Archives)','Barkat Tea House (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(12751,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/markets/mahavir-super-market-in-ci_XIUwoEa.png','Mahavir Super Market in Cidco[1]','Mahavir Super Market in Cidco[1]','https://www.justdial.com/Aurangabad-Maharashtra/Mahavir-Super-Market-Cidco-N-5-Cannought-Place-Near-Agrasen-Bhavan-Cidco/9999PX240-X240-101002121806-U6F7_BZDET'),(12760,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/markets/gul-mandi2-9b5af6d3.png','Gul Mandi[2]','Gul Mandi[2]','https://www.picnicwale.com/places/Maharashtra/gulmandi-market'),(12765,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/markets/himroo-fabric3-599ae12e.png','Himroo Fabric[3]','Himroo Fabric[3]','https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/travel/aurangabad/travel-guide/paithani-and-himroo-fabric-shopping/gs50836194.cms'),(12768,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/markets/situated-near-one-of-the-c_blotc8R.png','Situated near one of the city’s historical gates, Paithan Gate Market is known for its traditional goods, particularly Paithani sarees and other handloom items.[4]','Situated near one of the city’s historical gates, Paithan Gate Market is known for its traditional goods, particularly Paithani sarees and other handloom items.[4]','https://www.justdial.com/Aurangabad-Maharashtra/Paithan-Gate-Paithan-Gate-Tilaknagar/9999PX240-X240-220318021713-D7Z2_BZDET'),(12771,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/markets/prozone-mall-located-in-ch_873GMzy.png','Prozone Mall, located in Chikalthana near the airport, is the largest and most modern shopping complex in Chhatrapati Sambhaji Nagar. Spanning over 600,000 square feet, it is designed horizontally—one of the few of its kind in India.[5]','Prozone Mall, located in Chikalthana near the airport, is the largest and most modern shopping complex in Chhatrapati Sambhaji Nagar. Spanning over 600,000 square feet, it is designed horizontally—one of the few of its kind in India.[5]','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prozone_Mall_Aurangabad'),(12774,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/markets/nirala-bazaar-is-a-commerc_pc0Atvb.png','Nirala Bazaar is a commercial artery in the city, known for its upscale showrooms and branded outlets. Unlike the traditional bazaars, this market has a modern outlook and caters to the city’s urban population. Electronics, smartphones, branded apparel, and accessories dominate the retail landscape here. With ample parking space and wide roads, Nirala Bazaar attracts middle- and upper-class consumers.[6]','Nirala Bazaar is a commercial artery in the city, known for its upscale showrooms and branded outlets. Unlike the traditional bazaars, this market has a modern outlook and caters to the city’s urban population. Electronics, smartphones, branded apparel, and accessories dominate the retail landscape here. With ample parking space and wide roads, Nirala Bazaar attracts middle- and upper-class consumers.[6]','https://www.justdial.com/Aurangabad-Maharashtra/Apple-Authorised-Service-Provider-Opposite-Akashwani-Above-Metro-Shose-Nirala-Bazar/9999PX240-X240-180927064238-P2I8_BZDET'),(12792,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/sports-games/football-in-aurangaba_0gtWACi.png','Football in Aurangabad is experiencing growth and development, with plans to enhance the infrastructure for the sport. The Maharashtra government has announced the construction of an international standard football stadium at Amkhas Maidan, which is located on Wakf Board land in Chhatrapati Sambhaji Nagar.[1]','Football in Aurangabad is experiencing growth and development, with plans to enhance the infrastructure for the sport. The Maharashtra government has announced the construction of an international standard football stadium at Amkhas Maidan, which is located on Wakf Board land in Chhatrapati Sambhaji Nagar.[1]','https://divyamarathi.bhaskar.com/local/maharashtra/aurangabad/news/a-20-day-sports-festival-at-amkhas-maidan-under-nashamukt-abhiyan-130493038.html'),(12796,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/sports-games/ankit-ramdas-bawne-bo_hrx8b9E.png','Ankit Ramdas Bawne, born on December 17, 1992, in Paitha, Aurangabad, Maharashtra, isan Indiancricketer who represents Maharashtra in domestic cricket. He is a right-handed middle-order batsman known for his solid technique and consistency, boasting a first-class batting average of over 50.[2]','Ankit Ramdas Bawne, born on December 17, 1992, in Paitha, Aurangabad, Maharashtra, isan Indiancricketer who represents Maharashtra in domestic cricket. He is a right-handed middle-order batsman known for his solid technique and consistency, boasting a first-class batting average of over 50.[2]','https://www.cricx.com/player/ankit-bawne/'),(12799,'culture/images/maharashtra/chhatrapati-sambhaji-nagar/sports-games/iqbal-rashid-siddiqui_GcOhPBv.png','Iqbal Rashid Siddiqui, born on December 26, 1974, in Aurangabad, Maharashtra, is a former Indian cricketer known for his right-handed batting and right-arm medium-fast bowling. He made his debut for Maharashtra in the 1992-93 Ranji Trophy and has since contributed to the state team with both bat and ball.[3]','Iqbal Rashid Siddiqui, born on December 26, 1974, in Aurangabad, Maharashtra, is a former Indian cric