ani-mand_IMDwxYW.jpg','The shikhara of the Tulja Bhavani Mandir rising prominently above the fortified complex. (Source: CKA Archives)','The shikhara of the Tulja Bhavani Mandir rising prominently above the fortified complex. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(12861,'culture/images/maharashtra/dharashiv/architecture/the-highly-vaulted-dome-of-the-hazrat-_uKHkCSL.jpg','The highly vaulted dome of the Hazrat Khwaja Shamshuddin Dargah in Khwaja Nagar, Dharashiv. (Source: CKA Archives)','The highly vaulted dome of the Hazrat Khwaja Shamshuddin Dargah in Khwaja Nagar, Dharashiv. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(12864,'culture/images/maharashtra/dharashiv/architecture/entrance-of-paranda-fort-dharashiv-fea_Jb79DHo.jpg','Entrance of Paranda Fort, Dharashiv, featuring massive stone bastions and surrounded by khadak-style defensive walls. (Source: CKA Archives)','Entrance of Paranda Fort, Dharashiv, featuring massive stone bastions and surrounded by khadak-style defensive walls. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(12866,'culture/images/maharashtra/dharashiv/architecture/jami-masjid-inside-paranda-fort-featur_PYSzN4Y.jpg','Jami Masjid inside Paranda Fort, featuring a 27-bayed prayer hall and a domed Hamam, reflecting Islamic architectural traditions. (Source: CKA Archives)','Jami Masjid inside Paranda Fort, featuring a 27-bayed prayer hall and a domed Hamam, reflecting Islamic architectural traditions. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(12889,'culture/images/maharashtra/dharashiv/artforms/burud-artisan-selling-baskets-and-brooms-a_1FsqFJ9.jpg','Burud artisan selling baskets and brooms at Athawadi Bazaar, Dharashiv. (Source: CKA Archives)','Burud artisan selling baskets and brooms at Athawadi Bazaar, Dharashiv. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(12891,'culture/images/maharashtra/dharashiv/artforms/bamboo-stacked-along-a-roadside-in-dharash_97FmeaL.jpg','Bamboo stacked along a roadside in Dharashiv, ready for processing. (Source: CKA Archives)','Bamboo stacked along a roadside in Dharashiv, ready for processing. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(12893,'culture/images/maharashtra/dharashiv/artforms/ladder-construction-underway-at-a-bamboo-w_tiyjZna.jpg','Ladder construction underway at a bamboo workshop in Dharashiv. (Source: CKA Archives)','Ladder construction underway at a bamboo workshop in Dharashiv. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(12896,'culture/images/maharashtra/dharashiv/artforms/the-kumbhar-artisans-maintain-a-presence-i_iWvWwlJ.jpg','The Kumbhar artisans maintain a presence in the Athawadi Bazaar, where their colorful stalls display pots in various stages of production—some sun-drying while others are already painted and ready for sale. (Source: CKA Archives)','The Kumbhar artisans maintain a presence in the Athawadi Bazaar, where their colorful stalls display pots in various stages of production—some sun-drying while others are already painted and ready for sale. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(12900,'culture/images/maharashtra/dharashiv/artforms/artisan-holding-a-murti-of-bhagwaan-ganesh_ljaX20C.jpg','Artisan holding a murti of Bhagwaan Ganesh in Dharashiv. (Source: CKA Archives)','Artisan holding a murti of Bhagwaan Ganesh in Dharashiv. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(12902,'culture/images/maharashtra/dharashiv/artforms/murtis-of-bhagwaan-ganesh-stacked-for-stor_j8BfPBM.jpg','Murtis of Bhagwaan Ganesh stacked for storage at a workshop in Dharashiv. (Source: CKA Archives)','Murtis of Bhagwaan Ganesh stacked for storage at a workshop in Dharashiv. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(12906,'culture/images/maharashtra/dharashiv/artforms/zhaap-baskets-displayed-for-sale-at-parand_bnhqZO1.jpg','Zhaap baskets displayed for sale at Paranda market. (Source: CKA Archives)','Zhaap baskets displayed for sale at Paranda market. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(12908,'culture/images/maharashtra/dharashiv/artforms/artisan-weaving-a-zhaap-basket-at-home-in-_FDcGu4W.jpg','Artisan weaving a zhaap basket at home in Paranda. (Source: CKA Archives)','Artisan weaving a zhaap basket at home in P