/the-upper-storey-features-a-covered-t_7gCRAdk.jpg','The upper storey features a covered terrace, enclosed by carved wooden railings and shaded by the extended roof. Unlike a projecting balcony, this space is more integrated into the building, serving as a semi-open extension of the interiors. (Source: CKA Archives)','The upper storey features a covered terrace, enclosed by carved wooden railings and shaded by the extended roof. Unlike a projecting balcony, this space is more integrated into the building, serving as a semi-open extension of the interiors. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(13692,'culture/images/maharashtra/gadchiroli/architecture/the-lattice-style-railing-allows-for-_V9HqnaJ.jpg','The lattice-style railing allows for airflow while maintaining privacy, making it well-suited for the region’s climate. (Source: CKA Archives)','The lattice-style railing allows for airflow while maintaining privacy, making it well-suited for the region’s climate. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(13709,'culture/images/maharashtra/gadchiroli/artforms/a-ladder-colloquially-known-as-aja-made-f_emJ7BuF.jpg','A ladder, colloquially known as Aja, made from bamboo in Gadchiroli. (Source: CKA Archives)','A ladder, colloquially known as Aja, made from bamboo in Gadchiroli. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(13712,'culture/images/maharashtra/gadchiroli/artforms/a-comb-made-from-wood-by-the-madia-commun_JnIeojr.jpg','A Comb made from wood by the Madia Community in Gadchiroli. (Source: CKA Archives)','A Comb made from wood by the Madia Community in Gadchiroli. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(13716,'culture/images/maharashtra/gadchiroli/artforms/participants-at-the-training-center-engag_s6x7WQE.png','Participants at the training center engaged in craftwork within the former tehsildar’s office in Bhamragad, Gadchiroli.[2]','Participants at the training center engaged in craftwork within the former tehsildar’s office in Bhamragad, Gadchiroli.[2]','https://thebetterindia.com/215954/ias-hero-manuj-jindal-mah