-in-the-house-are-small-in-si_5Vv5Wiw.jpg','The windows in the house are small in size. Some have wooden shutters. (Source: CKA Archives)','The windows in the house are small in size. Some have wooden shutters. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14255,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/some-windows-as-seen-here-have-wooden-bo_EvFfzPm.jpg','Some windows, as seen here, have wooden borders and iron rods. (Source: CKA Archives)','Some windows, as seen here, have wooden borders and iron rods. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14257,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/here-the-roof-of-the-house-has-been-exte_CYg1pnB.jpg','Here, the roof of the house has been extended outward to ensure the veranda’s protection during the monsoon season. (Source: CKA Archives)','Here, the roof of the house has been extended outward to ensure the veranda’s protection during the monsoon season. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14259,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/the-ceiling-of-the-house-is-made-of-wood_w3n5zt8.jpg','The ceiling of the house is made of wood. (Source: CKA Archives)','The ceiling of the house is made of wood. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14260,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/there-is-a-small-fixture-on-the-roof-fro_ZDKYs2I.jpg','There is a small fixture on the roof from which people can hang several items. (Source: CKA Archives)','There is a small fixture on the roof from which people can hang several items. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14262,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/a-notable-feature-of-the-residence-is-th_ykZrgPL.jpg','A notable feature of the residence is the built-in storage in the wall. This can be found at multiple spots across the house. (Source: CKA Archives)','A notable feature of the residence is the built-in storage in the wall. This can be found at multiple spots across the house. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14263,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/yet-another-type-of-storage-space-built-_ZGBs5OI.jpg','Yet another type of storage space built into the wall. This one is smaller than the one we saw earlier. This type is called a “Devali.” (Source: CKA Archives)','Yet another type of storage space built into the wall. This one is smaller than the one we saw earlier. This type is called a “Devali.” (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14266,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/this-house-is-situated-in-the-umara-vill_J57Dz5C.jpg','This house is situated in the Umara village in Hingoli. Notice how the stairs lead up to the veranda, which is at a height of about four feet from the ground. (Source: CKA Archives)','This house is situated in the Umara village in Hingoli. Notice how the stairs lead up to the veranda, which is at a height of about four feet from the ground. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14267,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/there-is-a-narrow-street-right-beside-th_RC3XeAz.jpg','There is a narrow street right beside the house. (Source: CKA Archives)','There is a narrow street right beside the house. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14270,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/this-blue-door-stands-at-the-entrance-of_C0ECPQq.jpg','This blue door stands at the entrance of the house and it’s height is of about five feet. (Source: CKA Archives)','This blue door stands at the entrance of the house and it’s height is of about five feet. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14271,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/entrance-of-the-house-source-cka-archive_k1f8ysS.jpg','Entrance of the house. (Source: CKA Archives)','Entrance of the house. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14273,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/the-windows-in-the-house-are-made-of-woo_wLvse0Z.jpg','The windows in the house are made of wood and metal. (Source: CKA Archives)','The windows in the house are made of wood and metal. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14274,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/this-is-an-upper-clerestory-window-in-th_Zcz9unu.jpg','This is an upper clerestory window in the house which facilitates ventilation. (Source: CKA Archives)','This is an upper clerestory window in the house which facilitates ventilation. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14275,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/this-upper-clerestory-window-has-decorat_0QfazhO.jpg','This upper clerestory window has decorative metal grills. Notice how this type of window may facilitate ventilation. (Source: CKA Archives)','This upper clerestory window has decorative metal grills. Notice how this type of window may facilitate ventilation. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14277,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/the-ceiling-of-the-house-has-been-built-_qopI3oP.jpg','The ceiling of the house has been built using a combination of cement and metal. (Source: CKA Archives)','The ceiling of the house has been built using a combination of cement and metal. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14278,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/the-ceiling-in-the-kitchen-unlike-in-the_Hopi4uS.jpg','The ceiling in the kitchen, unlike in the rest of the house, is made using metal sheets on a wooden framework. (Source: CKA Archives)','The ceiling in the kitchen, unlike in the rest of the house, is made using metal sheets on a wooden framework. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14281,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/a-residence-named-kaushalya-niwas-in-kar_fkIdINE.jpg','A residence named “Kaushalya Niwas” in Karwadi Village. (Source: CKA Archives)','A residence named “Kaushalya Niwas” in Karwadi Village. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14282,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/this-street-view-of-the-locality-shows-h_PvdKlNg.jpg','This street view of the locality shows how two sides of the house face the street. (Source: CKA Archives)','This street view of the locality shows how two sides of the house face the street. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14283,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/the-gate-has-metal-carvings-of-peacocks-_YUb0JsR.jpg','The gate has metal carvings of peacocks. (Source: CKA Archives)','The gate has metal carvings of peacocks. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14285,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/the-main-entrance-door-is-wooden-and-dou_R41ULWw.jpg','The main entrance door is wooden and double-shuttered. It has distinctive floral carvings on it. The tiles on the wall beside the door are of a unique style called Dholpuri. (Source: CKA Archives)','The main entrance door is wooden and double-shuttered. It has distinctive floral carvings on it. The tiles on the wall beside the door are of a unique style called Dholpuri. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14287,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/the-family-living-in-the-house-has-adorn_PNEX45Q.jpg','The family living in the house has adorned the entrance with a “toran.” (Source: CKA Archives)','The family living in the house has adorned the entrance with a “toran.” (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14289,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/notice-how-the-border-of-the-window-is-t_1h0pI6Z.jpg','Notice how the border of the window is the same as the border around the main door. (Source: CKA Archives)','Notice how the border of the window is the same as the border around the main door. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14290,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/an-upper-clerestory-window-fitted-with-m_sTIq1O0.jpg','An upper clerestory window, fitted with metal grills and a glass panel, provides ventilation and light. (Source: CKA Archives)','An upper clerestory window, fitted with metal grills and a glass panel, provides ventilation and light. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14291,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/architecture/the-interior-of-the-house-is-modern-yet-_wI5m31D.jpg','The interior of the house is modern yet simple. It features a gold and purple aesthetic. (Source: CKA Archives)','The interior of the house is modern yet simple. It f