-6d78c000.png','Sol Kadhi[1]','Sol Kadhi[1]','https://www.vegrecipesofindia.com/kokum-curry-sol-kadhi/'),(14384,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/food/a-box-of-sauf-source-cka-archives-88593523.jpg','A box of sauf  (Source: CKA Archives)','A box of sauf  (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14390,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/food/mango-pickle-source-cka-archives-ac66bf3c.jpg','Mango Pickle (Source: CKA Archives)','Mango Pickle (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14392,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/food/lemon-pickle-source-cka-archives-94ebfdd5.jpg','Lemon Pickle (Source: CKA Archives)','Lemon Pickle (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14394,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/food/chilli-pickle-source-cka-archives-7a899032.jpg','Chilli Pickle (Source: CKA Archives)','Chilli Pickle (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14402,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/food/a-local-liquor-store-in-hingoli-source-cka-archi_90xbmum.jpg','A local liquor store in Hingoli (Source: CKA Archives)','A local liquor store in Hingoli (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14409,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/food/mugudasource-cka-archives-c733cf76.jpg','Muguda(Source: CKA Archives)','Muguda(Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14413,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/food/hotel-malkarisource-cka-archives-eeb4023a.jpg','Hotel Malkari(Source: CKA Archives)','Hotel Malkari(Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14417,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/food/hotel-malkarisource-cka-archives-881b3350.jpg','Hotel Malkari(Source: CKA Archives)','Hotel Malkari(Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14418,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/food/people-lining-up-for-bhajiat-hotelmalkari-source_1VqvbFU.jpg','People lining up for bhajiat HotelMalkari (Source: CKA Archives)','People lining up for bhajiat HotelMalkari (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14421,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/food/mahaveer-ice-cream-and-fast-food-restaurant2-851a640f.png','Mahaveer Ice Cream and Fast Food Restaurant[2]','Mahaveer Ice Cream and Fast Food Restaurant[2]','https://www.justdial.com/Hingoli/Mahaveer-Icecream-And-Fast-Food-Restaurant-Hingoli-Washim-Akola-Road/9999P2456-2456-220703235120-M4T8_BZDET?ncatid=10445766&area=&search=Best%20South%20Indian%20Restaurants%20in%20Hingoli%20-%20Order%20Food%20Online&mncatname=South%20Indian%20Restaurants&abd_btn=&abd_heading=&bd=1&'),(14424,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/food/maharaj-bhajiyewale3-52ae9ff3.jpg','Maharaj Bhajiyewale[3]','Maharaj Bhajiyewale[3]','https://www.justdial.com/Hingoli/Maharaj-Bhajiyewale-Siddharth-Nagar/9999P2456-2456-220628221448-M9G8_BZDET?ncatid=10200860&area=&search=Best%20Fast%20Food%20in%20Hingoli%20-%20Order%20Food%20Online&mncatname=Fast%20Food&abd_btn=&abd_heading=&bd=1&'),(14427,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/food/ambika-sweets-and-namkeen-source-cka-archives-368e694d.jpg','Ambika Sweets and Namkeen (Source: CKA Archives)','Ambika Sweets and Namkeen (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14430,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/food/prabhudas-ramchandra-sweets-source-cka-archives-7b3d0515.jpg','Prabhudas Ramchandra Sweets (Source: CKA Archives)','Prabhudas Ramchandra Sweets (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14440,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/language/image-no-caption-fe9cb163.png','Image (no caption)','Image (no caption)',NULL),(14454,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/markets/turmeric-from-the-region-is-primarily-traded-_cPAGMRu.png','Turmeric from the region is primarily traded through the APMC mandis, especially in Hingoli city, Vasmat, and Basmat. The Hingoli APMC mandi, located near the railway station, handles large volumes of turmeric during peak harvest and trading seasons, particularly from December to April. Farmers bring their produce in gunny bags or tractor-trolleys, and traders inspect the fingers and bulbs for color, dryness, and texture before bidding. Prices generally vary based on grade, moisture content, and seasonal supply-demand dynamics. During peak season, prices can range between ₹10,000 to ₹14,000 per quintal, with top-quality Vasmat Haldi attracting even higher rates.[1]','Turmeric from the region is primarily traded through the APMC mandis, especially in Hingoli city, Vasmat, and Basmat. The Hingoli APMC mandi, located near the railway station, handles large volumes of turmeric during peak harvest and trading seasons, particularly from December to April. Farmers bring their produce in gunny bags or tractor-trolleys, and traders inspect the fingers and bulbs for color, dryness, and texture before bidding. Prices generally vary based on grade, moisture content, and seasonal supply-demand dynamics. During peak season, prices can range between ₹10,000 to ₹14,000 per quintal, with top-quality Vasmat Haldi attracting even higher rates.[1]','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vasmat_turmeric'),(14475,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/sports-games/a-normal-surna-pati-formation-shown-on-a_NoeO7gV.jpg','A normal Surna Pati formation shown on a paper,(Source: CKA Archives).','A normal Surna Pati formation shown on a paper,(Source: CKA Archives).',NULL),(14480,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/sports-games/wagh-bakari-is-a-two-player-game-where-o_jQ0PN1Y.jpg','Wagh Bakari is a two-player game where one player controls the Wagh (tiger) and the other has 16 Bakari (goats).','Wagh Bakari is a two-player game where one player controls the Wagh (tiger) and the other has 16 Bakari (goats).',NULL),(14484,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/sports-games/established-by-pandurang-lunge-in-1960-t_tveaaPN.jpg','Established by Pandurang Lunge in 1960, this Vyayam Shala has produced notable wrestlers,(Source: CKA Archives).','Established by Pandurang Lunge in 1960, this Vyayam Shala has produced notable wrestlers,(Source: CKA Archives).',NULL),(14487,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/sports-games/established-in-1994-by-bharat-chaudhari-_dSdAujJ.jpg','Established in 1994 by Bharat Chaudhari, who represented Maharashtra Kesari, he began his wrestling journey in 1987 and concluded his professional career in 1998. He trained alongside his partner, Jamal Khan, who also started his wrestling career in 1987 and retired in 1998 (Source: CKA Archives).','Established in 1994 by Bharat Chaudhari, who represented Maharashtra Kesari, he began his wrestling journey in 1987 and concluded his professional career in 1998. He trained alongside his partner, Jamal Khan, who also started his wrestling career in 1987 and retired in 1998 (Source: CKA Archives).',NULL),(14497,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/stories/mallinath-digambar-jain1-3bbac323.png','Mallinath Digambar Jain[1]','Mallinath Digambar Jain[1]','https://jaingyandarshan.wordpress.com/2015/12/31/%E0%A4%B6%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%80-%E0%A5%A7%E0%A5%A6%E0%A5%A6%E0%A5%AE-%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%B2%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B2%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%A8%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%A5-%E0%A4%A6%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%97%E0%A4%AE%E0%A5%8D/'),(14505,'culture/images/maharashtra/hingoli/stories/bharud-performance2-f556673d.png','Bharud Performance[2]','Bharud Performance[2]','https://www.prathaculturalschool.com/post/bharud'),(14512,'culture/images/maharashtra/jalgaon/architecture/the-changdev-mandir-built-in-the-hemadpa_sjZFWn9.jpg','The Changdev Mandir, built in the Hemadpanthi architectural style, showcases a base with a series of mouldings and a pancha-ratha plan with five projections.[1]','The Changdev Mandir, built in the Hemadpanthi architectural style, showcases a base with a series of mouldings and a pancha-ratha plan with five projections.[1]','https://puratattva.in/changdev/'),(14516,'culture/images/maharashtra/jalgaon/architecture/the-remains-of-bahadarpur-fort-built-in-_zbOMqY4.png','The remains of Bahadarpur Fort, built in a defensive architectural style.[2]','The remains of Bahadarpur Fort, built in a defensive architectural style.[2]','https://durgbharari.in/bahadarpur/'),(14520,'culture/images/maharashtra/jalgaon/architecture/main-entrance-of-parola-fort-in-jalgaon-_tZlEenH.png','Main entrance of Parola Fort in Jalgaon, showcasing 16th-century military architecture built with stone and mortar, where a drawbridge and towers once stood.[3]','Main entrance of Parola Fort in Jalgaon, showcasing 16th-century military architecture built with stone and mortar, where a drawbridge and towers once stood.[3]','https://www.fortsmaharashtra.com/parola-fort/'),(14526,'culture/images/maharashtra/jalgaon/architecture/the-beautiful-facade-of-the-bharambe-wad_8JUwaa5.jpg','The beautiful facade of the Bharambe Wada of Faizpur. (Source: CKA Archives)','The beautiful facade of the Bharambe Wada of Faizpur. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14528,'culture/images/maharashtra/jalgaon/architecture/a-view-of-one-of-the-entrances-to-the-wa_gKXS9mO.jpg','A view of one of the entrances to the Wada, featuring an intricately carved wooden arch framing a solid wooden door. The entrance is characteristic of traditional Wada architecture, with its emphasis on craftsmanship and its large scale. (Source: CKA Archives)','A view of one of the entrances to the Wada, featuring an intricately carved wooden arch framing a solid wooden door. The entrance is characteristic of traditional Wada architecture, with its emphasis on craftsmanship and its large scale. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14530,'culture/images/maharashtra/jalgaon/architecture/a-wooden-double-leaf-door-embedded-withi_AmDjsSS.jpg','A Wooden double-leaf door embedded within a wooden frame. The craftsmanship highlights the design aesthetics typical of Wada architecture which seems to be fading away from contemporary building practices. (Source: CKA Archives)','A Wooden double-leaf door embedded within a wooden frame. The craftsmanship highlights the design aesthetics typical of Wada architecture which seems to be fading away from contemporary building practices. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14531,'culture/images/maharashtra/jalgaon/architecture/another-example-of-a-wooden-double-leaf-_RnSel24.jpg','Another example of a wooden double-leaf door, with meticulous craftsmanship that speaks to the fading artistry of Wada architectural design.\" (Source: CKA Archives)','Another example of a wooden double-leaf door, with meticulous craftsmanship that speaks to the fading artistry of Wada architectural design.\" (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14532,'culture/images/maharashtra/jalgaon/architecture/the-locking-system-of-these-doors-typica_KN3yx8u.jpg','The locking system of these doors typically consists of a chain and padlock. (Source: CKA Archives)','The locking system of these doors typically consists of a chain and padlock. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14533,'culture/images/maharashtra/jalgaon/architecture/close-up-of-the-locking-system-featuring_R5xUk42.jpg','Close-up of the locking system, featuring a chain and padlock, commonly used in traditional wooden doors of Wada architecture. (Source: CKA Archives)','Close-up of the locking system, featuring a chain and padlock, commonly used in traditional wooden doors of Wada architecture. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14535,'culture/images/maharashtra/jalgaon/architecture/an-exterior-view-of-the-wadas-windows-hi_tMH5875.jpg','An exterior view of the Wada’s windows, highlighting their proportional arrangement and the contrast between the ground and upper storey designs. The use of wooden trims and security grills here highlights the ways both functional and aesthetic considerations were incorporated into the building traditions of the time. (Source: CKA Archives)','An exterior view of the Wada’s windows, highlighting their proportional arrangement and the contrast between the ground and upper storey designs. The use of wooden trims and security grills here highlights the ways both functional and aesthetic considerations were incorporated into the building traditions of the time. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14536,'culture/images/maharashtra/jalgaon/architecture/an-interior-view-of-a-tall-window-at-the_d4c3qcE.jpg','An interior view of a tall window at the facade of the upper storey, showcasing its arched top and railing at the bottom, which allows for airflow while maintaining security. (Source: CKA Archives)','An interior view of a tall window at the facade of the upper storey, showcasing its arched top and railing at the bottom, which allows for airflow while maintaining security. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14537,'culture/images/maharashtra/jalgaon/architecture/a-street-facing-perspective-of-a-window-_s6DwWrJ.jpg','A street-facing perspective of a window with a similar window, illustrating how it integrates with the overall look of the exterior of the Wada. (Source: CKA Archives)','A street-facing perspective of a window with a similar window, illustrating how it integrates with the overall look of the exterior of the Wada. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14539,'culture/images/maharashtra/jalgaon/architecture/side-view-of-the-bharambe-wada-highlight_E7gx27c.jpg','Side view of the Bharambe Wada, highlighting the verandah and low plinth. The verandah functions as a transitional space, easing movement between the street and the home’s interior. (Source: CKA Archives)','Side view of the Bharambe Wada, highlighting the verandah and low plinth. The verandah functions as a transitional space, easing movement between the street and the home’s interior. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14541,'culture/images/maharashtra/jalgaon/architecture/the-central-courtyard-of-the-bharambe-wa_Bs963FL.jpg','The central courtyard of the Bharambe Wada. Notice the way the interior spaces within the residence circle around this area. (Source: CKA Archives)','The central courtyard of the Bharambe Wada. Notice the way the interior spaces within the residence circle around this area. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14543,'culture/images/maharashtra/jalgaon/architecture/the-roof-of-the-wada-sloping-inwards-tow_pGbNzIq.jpg','The roof of the Wada sloping inwards toward the courtyard. (Source: CKA Archives)','The roof of the Wada sloping inwards toward the courtyard. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(14562,'culture/images/maharashtra/jalg