apur. Source: CKA Archives','Keshavrao Bhonsle Natyagruha, a historic theater in Kolhapur. Source: CKA Archives',''),(15600,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/paintings-on-the-wall-of-keshavrao-bhosale-_tno4qFL.jpg','Paintings on the wall of Keshavrao Bhosale Natyagruha depicting a glimpse of the history of this art in the region. Source: CKA Archives','Paintings on the wall of Keshavrao Bhosale Natyagruha depicting a glimpse of the history of this art in the region. Source: CKA Archives',''),(15602,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/nirzaar-a-contemporary-play-presented-by-co_ps7ZpLb.jpg','Nirzaar, a contemporary play presented by college students at Keshavrao Bhosale Natyagruha, showcasing the region’s evolving theatrical landscape. Source: CKA Archives','Nirzaar, a contemporary play presented by college students at Keshavrao Bhosale Natyagruha, showcasing the region’s evolving theatrical landscape. Source: CKA Archives',''),(15606,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/traces-of-shahu-maharajs-legacy-can-still-b_fnpQOfS.jpg','Traces of Shahu Maharaj’s legacy can still be seen in Kolhapur today, in the form of Sangeet Vidyalayas that continue to nurture the region’s musical talents. Source: CKA Archives','Traces of Shahu Maharaj’s legacy can still be seen in Kolhapur today, in the form of Sangeet Vidyalayas that continue to nurture the region’s musical talents. Source: CKA Archives',''),(15610,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/baburao-painter-the-pioneering-filmmaker-an_iH3PiFG.png','Baburao Painter , the pioneering filmmaker and founder of Maharashtra Film Company, is credited with shaping the early years of Kolhapur\'s cinematic legacy.[1]','Baburao Painter , the pioneering filmmaker and founder of Maharashtra Film Company, is credited with shaping the early years of Kolhapur\'s cinematic legacy.[1]','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baburao_Painter'),(15615,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/kolhapuri-chappals-with-their-different-sty_iwc1RUd.jpg','Kolhapuri Chappals, with their different styles displayed on the walls of a shop. Source: CKA Archives','Kolhapuri Chappals, with their different styles displayed on the walls of a shop. Source: CKA Archives',''),(15619,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/sheets-of-chemically-processed-leather-sour_UW9a2e0.jpg','Sheets of chemically processed leather. Source: CKA Archives','Sheets of chemically processed leather. Source: CKA Archives',''),(15620,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/a-stencil-used-to-cut-the-leather-for-the-s_VU0BJua.jpg','A stencil used to cut the leather for the sole. Source: CKA Archives','A stencil used to cut the leather for the sole. Source: CKA Archives',''),(15622,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/the-two-soles-are-hammered-together-using-a_asBOCyu.jpg','The two soles are hammered together using asti to form a solid base. Source: CKA Archives','The two soles are hammered together using asti to form a solid base. Source: CKA Archives',''),(15623,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/a-raapi-is-used-to-make-intricate-cuts-in-t_oNiZYbB.jpg','A raapi is used to make intricate cuts in the leather straps for detailed designs. Source: CKA Archives','A raapi is used to make intricate cuts in the leather straps for detailed designs. Source: CKA Archives',''),(15624,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/the-two-sole-layers-are-hand-stitched-to-se_X1loVzL.jpg','The two sole layers are hand-stitched to secure the structure and enhance durability. Source: CKA Archives','The two sole layers are hand-stitched to secure the structure and enhance durability. Source: CKA Archives',''),(15625,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/the-fully-stitched-sole-forms-the-foundatio_cumf7eZ.jpg','The fully stitched sole forms the foundation on which straps and decorative elements will be added. Source: CKA Archives','The fully stitched sole forms the foundation on which straps and decorative elements will be added. Source: CKA Archives',''),(15626,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/thin-leather-strips-are-cut-using-araapito-_LzX5MUb.jpg','Thin leather strips are cut using araapito create straps used for design and structure. Source: CKA Archives','Thin leather strips are cut using araapito create straps used for design and structure. Source: CKA Archives',''),(15627,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/leather-strips-coated-with-doodh-a-glue-sol_RLeLyYw.jpg','Leather strips, coated with doodh (a glue solution), are braided into veni, which will be attached as decorative features. Source: CKA Archives','Leather strips, coated with doodh (a glue solution), are braided into veni, which will be attached as decorative features. Source: CKA Archives',''),(15628,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/chandnispiral-designs-andgonderound-motifs-_jGi2XFi.jpg','Chandni(spiral) designs andgonde(round motifs) are formed from leather using fine hand tools. Source: CKA Archives','Chandni(spiral) designs andgonde(round motifs) are formed from leather using fine hand tools. Source: CKA Archives',''),(15629,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/the-thumb-strap-is-measured-and-fitted-care_RaW70bs.jpg','The thumb strap is measured and fitted carefully to ensure comfort and stability. Source: CKA Archives','The thumb strap is measured and fitted carefully to ensure comfort and stability. Source: CKA Archives',''),(15631,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/larger-straps-featuring-braided-veni-and-go_RdikcZp.jpg','Larger straps featuring braided veni and gonda motifs are fixed onto the sole, completing the upper portion of the chappal. Source: CKA Archives','Larger straps featuring braided veni and gonda motifs are fixed onto the sole, completing the upper portion of the chappal. Source: CKA Archives',''),(15633,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/ready-to-sell-kolhapuri-chappal-source-cka-_BzsUxvi.jpg','Ready to sell Kolhapuri chappal. Source: CKA Archives','Ready to sell Kolhapuri chappal. Source: CKA Archives',''),(15637,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/a-kolhapuri-saaj-featuring-detailed-gold-wo_11eRVce.jpg','A Kolhapuri saaj featuring detailed gold work and traditional motifs, crafted by local artisans. Source: CKA Archives','A Kolhapuri saaj featuring detailed gold work and traditional motifs, crafted by local artisans. Source: CKA Archives',''),(15639,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/notice-the-symbolic-designs-such-as-the-fis_YFfdnWF.jpg','Notice the symbolic designs such as the fish and conch feature on a Saaj. They are often associated with prosperity and spiritual protection. Source: CKA Archives','Notice the symbolic designs such as the fish and conch feature on a Saaj. They are often associated with prosperity and spiritual protection. Source: CKA Archives',''),(15641,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/a-traditional-saaj-displayed-in-full-highli_YSzBv2a.jpg','A traditional saaj displayed in full, highlighting its intricate structure and layered symbolism. Source: CKA Archives','A traditional saaj displayed in full, highlighting its intricate structure and layered symbolism. Source: CKA Archives',''),(15643,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/an-artisans-metal-mold-daay-used-to-shape-i_SdxyCd9.jpg','An artisan’s metal mold (daay) used to shape individual components of the saaj with precision. Source: CKA Archives','An artisan’s metal mold (daay) used to shape individual components of the saaj with precision. Source: CKA Archives',''),(15647,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/artforms/an-artisan-at-work-near-the-khamgar-society_hpKZqEU.jpg','An artisan at work near the Khamgar Society Gate, shaping a traditional khalbatta, a small stone grinding tool still used in homes for preparing masalas and chutneys. Source: CKA Archives','An artisan at work near the Khamgar Society Gate, shaping a traditional khalbatta, a 