ace in Kolhapur (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(16112,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/sports-games/bulls-race-in-kolhapursource-cka-archiv_0Fte0Dd.jpg','Bulls Race in Kolhapur(Source: CKA Archives)','Bulls Race in Kolhapur(Source: CKA Archives)',''),(16145,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/sports-games/major-dhyanchand-hockey-stadium-kolhapu_UKelLXd.jpg','Major Dhyanchand Hockey Stadium, Kolhapur (Source: CKA Archives)','Major Dhyanchand Hockey Stadium, Kolhapur (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(16146,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/sports-games/hockey-pitch-of-major-dhyanchand-hockey_qQ6C8gl.jpg','Hockey pitch of Major Dhyanchand Hockey Stadium, Kolhapur (Source: CKA Archives)','Hockey pitch of Major Dhyanchand Hockey Stadium, Kolhapur (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(16149,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/sports-games/chh-shahu-stadium-kolhapur-source-cka-a_AfI71Xg.jpg','Chh. Shahu Stadium, Kolhapur (Source: CKA Archives)','Chh. Shahu Stadium, Kolhapur (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(16150,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/sports-games/practice-session-at-shahu-stadiumsource_VoybzQo.jpg','Practice session at Shahu Stadium(Source: CKA Archives)','Practice session at Shahu Stadium(Source: CKA Archives)',''),(16153,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/sports-games/shripati-khanchnale2-6e25082c.jpg','Shripati Khanchnale[2]','Shripati Khanchnale[2]','https://images.app.goo.gl/9MY1oVEL27paCe3t5'),(16156,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/sports-games/dadu-chougule3-1de686b6.jpg','Dadu Chougule[3]','Dadu Chougule[3]','https://images.app.goo.gl/kWFUxWJ1uzqBR7hB7'),(16159,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/sports-games/bhausaheb-nimbalkar4-ee9a3d06.jpg','Bhausaheb Nimbalkar[4]','Bhausaheb Nimbalkar[4]','https://images.app.goo.gl/PfQMMAS8EeshmAec7'),(16162,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapur/sports-games/siddharth-desai5-e294e4f4.jpg','Siddharth Desai[5]','Siddharth Desai[5]','https://images.app.goo.gl/2uz9EQz6VTKzgyaZ7'),(16165,'culture/images/maharashtra/kolhapu