urce: CKA Archives)','Devotees gathered around the Shivling at Nagareshwar Mandir.Nandi, the vahan of Bhagwan Shiv, is positioned directly in front. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(16367,'culture/images/maharashtra/latur/cultural-sites/neelkantheshwar-mandir-killarithe-only-m_ebVzILF.png','Neelkantheshwar Mandir, Killari.The only mandir in the village to remain undamaged during the 1993 earthquake, it is seen as a symbol of divine protection. (Source: CKA Archives)','Neelkantheshwar Mandir, Killari.The only mandir in the village to remain undamaged during the 1993 earthquake, it is seen as a symbol of divine protection. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(16371,'culture/images/maharashtra/latur/cultural-sites/exterior-of-neelkantheshwar-mandir-latur_Z9BOcE4.jpg','Exterior of Neelkantheshwar Mandir, Latur district.Built between the 12th and 14th centuries, the mandir features a tall shikhara and is constructed in the Hemadpanthi architectural style. (Source: CKA Archives)','Exterior of Neelkantheshwar Mandir, Latur district.Built between the 12th and 14th centuries, the mandir features a tall shikhara and is constructed in the Hemadpanthi architectural style. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(16373,'culture/images/maharashtra/latur/cultural-sites/carved-stone-sculptures-on-the-walls-of-_LP6kkez.jpg','Carved stone sculptures on the walls of Neelkantheshwar Mandir, Latur district.It is said that the mandir houses approximately 103 such figures. (Source: CKA Archives)','Carved stone sculptures on the walls of Neelkantheshwar Mandir, Latur district.It is said that the mandir houses approximately 103 such figures. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(16374,'culture/images/maharashtra/latur/cultural-sites/detail-of-the-mandirs-stone-exterior-sho_9H35rnt.png','Detail of the mandir’s stone exterior, showing both original carvings and areas repaired with cement.The structure continues to undergo maintenance while preserving its historical form. (Source: CKA Archives)','Detail of the mandir’