r, Latur.The site is named as the origin point for the surrounding locality. (Source: CKA Archives)','Exterior view of Renuka Devi Mandir, Latur.The site is named as the origin point for the surrounding locality. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(16387,'culture/images/maharashtra/latur/cultural-sites/sanctum-of-the-mandir-housing-the-image-_xbSM3mL.png','Sanctum of the mandir housing the image of Renuka Devi.Daily prayers and seasonal rituals continue to be held here. (Source: CKA Archives)','Sanctum of the mandir housing the image of Renuka Devi.Daily prayers and seasonal rituals continue to be held here. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(16390,'culture/images/maharashtra/latur/cultural-sites/entrance-to-syed-sadat-dargah-near-ausa-_WyiqA3V.jpg','Entrance to Syed Sadat Dargah near Ausa Fort in Latur.The site is believed by locals to be over seven centuries old. (Source: CKA Archives)','Entrance to Syed Sadat Dargah near Ausa Fort in Latur.The site is believed by locals to be over seven centuries old. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(16393,'culture/images/maharashtra/latur/cultural-sites/facade-of-shri-1008-chintamani-parshvana_u4M91ly.png','Facade of Shri 1008 Chintamani Parshvanath Jain Mandir, Old Latur.The current structure was restored in 2003. (Source: CKA Archives)','Facade of Shri 1008 Chintamani Parshvanath Jain Mandir, Old Latur.The current structure was restored in 2003. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(16394,'culture/images/maharashtra/latur/cultural-sites/black-stone-image-of-chintamani-parshvan_kKJfh18.png','Black stone image of Chintamani Parshvanath.The tirthankara is one of the most venerated figures in the Jain tradition. (Source: CKA Archives)','Black stone image of Chintamani Parshvanath.The tirthankara is one of the most venerated figures in the Jain tradition. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(16396,'culture/images/maharashtra/latur/cultural-sites/decorative-tile-and-carved-detail-on-the_fRtn4y6.png','Decorative tile and carved detail on the interior walls 