414,'culture/images/maharashtra/latur/cultural-sites/the-atmalinga-enshrined-in-a-small-cave-_PILNJPU.jpg','The atmalinga enshrined in a small, cave-like chamber within the mandir complex. Believed to be a self-manifested form of Bhagwan Shiv, it is regarded as his active, conscious presence. (Source: CKA Archives)','The atmalinga enshrined in a small, cave-like chamber within the mandir complex. Believed to be a self-manifested form of Bhagwan Shiv, it is regarded as his active, conscious presence. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(16417,'culture/images/maharashtra/latur/cultural-sites/entrance-to-siddhivinayak-ganesh-mandir-_MCR6Wy3.png','Entrance to Siddhivinayak Ganesh Mandir, Ganesh Chowk, Latur.The mandir is closely tied to the identity of the area and continues to be maintained by the same family for multiple generations. (Source: CKA Archives)','Entrance to Siddhivinayak Ganesh Mandir, Ganesh Chowk, Latur.The mandir is closely tied to the identity of the area and continues to be maintained by the same family for multiple generations. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(16419,'culture/images/maharashtra/latur/cultural-sites/ganesh-devta-of-thesiddhivinayak-ganesh-_N2slL0U.jpg','Ganesh Devta of theSiddhivinayak Ganesh Mandir, Ganesh Chowk, Latur.(Source: CKA Archives)','Ganesh Devta of theSiddhivinayak Ganesh Mandir, Ganesh Chowk, Latur.(Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(16420,'culture/images/maharashtra/latur/cultural-sites/the-mandirs-walls-are-adorned-with-beaut_vlEKhgW.jpg','The mandir’s walls are adorned with beautiful illustrations from the epics Ramayan and Mahabharat.(Source: CKA Archives)','The mandir’s walls are adorned with beautiful illustrations from the epics Ramayan and Mahabharat.(Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(16421,'culture/images/maharashtra/latur/cultural-sites/an-illustration-of-bhagwan-krishna-guidi_MttSlGN.jpg','An illustration of Bhagwan Krishna guiding Arjun’s chariot, a scene that recalls the Bhagavad Gita’s teaching on selfless action. (Source: C