ng','A live stage performance in Mumbai. The city’s theatre scene includes plays in Hindi, Marathi, Urdu, and English, often centred on social themes and known for engaging, interactive storytelling.[2]','A live stage performance in Mumbai. The city’s theatre scene includes plays in Hindi, Marathi, Urdu, and English, often centred on social themes and known for engaging, interactive storytelling.[2]','https://www.mid-day.com/lifestyle/culture/article/mumbai-theatre-festival-stages-five-hindi-plays-to-celebrate-the-language-lifestyle-18033174'),(17034,'culture/images/maharashtra/mumbai/artforms/shanta-gokhale-a-major-figure-in-the-movement_ItgPlVa.png','Shanta Gokhale, a major figure in the Movement[3]','Shanta Gokhale, a major figure in the Movement[3]','https://www.amazon.in/Scenes-We-Made-History-Experimental/dp/9354474802'),(17038,'culture/images/maharashtra/mumbai/artforms/affordable-recording-tools-and-digital-platfo_4xE4OWp.png','Affordable recording tools and digital platforms helped Dharavi rappers produce and share their music. YouTube and social media expanded their reach, while collectives likeGully Gangfostered collaboration. Artists like Divine and Naezy brought national attention to the scene, making Dharavi rap known for its raw, authentic voice.[4]','Affordable recording tools and digital platforms helped Dharavi rappers produce and share their music. YouTube and social media expanded their reach, while collectives likeGully Gangfostered collaboration. Artists like Divine and Naezy brought national attention to the scene, making Dharavi rap known for its raw, authentic voice.[4]','https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/entertainment/hindi/music/dharavi-mumbais-musical-slum/articleshow/61903382.cms'),(17041,'culture/images/maharashtra/mumbai/artforms/today-mumbais-streets-feature-murals-and-inst_WyNHeXS.png','Today, Mumbai’s streets feature murals and installations by local and international artists. Street art is now widely accepted, turning public spaces into open galleries. It sparks dialogue on social issues and plays a key role in shaping the city’s creative identity.[5]','Today, Mumbai’s streets feature murals and installations by local and international artists. Street art is now widely accepted, turning public spaces into open galleries. It sparks dialogue on social issues and plays a key role in shaping the city’s creative identity.[5]','https://hyperallergic.com/638450/budweiser-paints-over-street-murals-in-india/'),(17044,'culture/images/maharashtra/mumbai/artforms/kumbhars-storing-their-pots6-4ac61a58.png','Kumbhars storing their pots[6]','Kumbhars storing their pots[6]','https://121clicks.com/photo-stories/kumbharwada-dharavi-photography-rahul-machigar'),(17053,'culture/images/maharashtra/mumbai/artforms/this-annual-event-features-a-wide-array-of-fi_ASeshB7.png','This annual event features a wide array of films from India and around the globe, promoting cinema as an art form while facilitating dialogue among filmmakers, critics, and audiences. The festival includes categories such as international competition, Indian cinema, and documentaries, along with various screenings, panel discussions, and masterclasses.[7]','This annual event features a wide array of films from India and around the globe, promoting cinema as an art form while facilitating dialogue among filmmakers, critics, and audiences. The festival includes categories such as international competition, Indian cinema, and documentaries, along with various screenings, panel discussions, and masterclasses.[7]','https://madaboutmoviez.in/2015/10/07/17th-jio-mami-mumbai-film-festival-with-star-india-announces-its-stellar-program-line-up/'),(17056,'culture/images/maharashtra/mumbai/artforms/muaf-features-large-public-art-installations-_I14nKrF.png','MUAF features large public art installations, workshops, and live performances. With over 60 artists from India and abroad, it brings art into public spaces and encourages dialogue on urban issues.[8]','MUAF features large public art installations, workshops, and live performances. With over 60 artists from India and abroad, it brings art into public spaces and encourages dialogue on urban issues.[8]','https://www.indiatoday.in/magazine/leisure/story/20230130-mumbai-urban-art-festival-the-bombay-spirit-2324144-2023-01-20'),(17060,'culture/images/maharashtra/mumbai/artforms/kala-ghodas-black-horse-statue-surrounded-by-_o7pqyLn.png','Kala Ghoda’s black horse statue, surrounded by colonial-era buildings, marks the heart of South Mumbai’s art and heritage district.[9]','Kala Ghoda’s black horse statue, surrounded by colonial-era buildings, marks the heart of South Mumbai’s art and heritage district.[9]','https://www.thehindu.com/incoming/how-kala-ghoda-got-a-couture-makeover/article67167956.ece'),(17064,'culture/images/maharashtra/mumbai/artforms/jehangir-art-gallery-established-in-1952-in-s_pAYu3Sx.png','Jehangir Art Gallery, established in 1952 in South Mumbai, is a major venue for contemporary Indian art, hosting exhibitions and events across various art forms.[10]','Jehangir Art Gallery, established in 1952 in South Mumbai, is a major venue for contemporary Indian art, hosting exhibitions and events across various art forms.[10]','https://www.tripadvisor.in/ShowUserReviews-g304554-d324629-r365675923-Jehangir_Art_Gallery-Mumbai_Maharashtra.html'),(17068,'culture/images/maharashtra/mumbai/artforms/interior-of-the-royal-opera-house-in-mumbai-r_GXsUfdK.png','Interior of the Royal Opera House in Mumbai, restored to its original grandeur. A key heritage venue, it hosts a range of performances including theatre, music, and dance.[11]','Interior of the Royal Opera House in Mumbai, restored to its original grandeur. A key heritage venue, it hosts a range of performances including theatre, music, and dance.[11]','https://www.royaloperahouse.in/media-room/14-stages-of-culture-20'),(17071,'culture/images/maharashtra/mumbai/artforms/an-archival-image-of-the-bombay-store12-2ad