/maneckji-seth-agiary-parsi-imprint-on-mumbai/24474/'),(17662,'culture/images/maharashtra/mumbai/architecture/the-external-structure-of-the-siddhivinay_ByCEqjJ.png','The external structure of the Siddhivinayak Mandir at Prabhadevi, built in a Hindu temple architectural style, is considered an architectural feat.[5]','The external structure of the Siddhivinayak Mandir at Prabhadevi, built in a Hindu temple architectural style, is considered an architectural feat.[5]','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siddhivinayak_Temple,_Mumbai#/media/File:Shree_Siddhivinayak_Temple_Mumbai.jpg'),(17666,'culture/images/maharashtra/mumbai/architecture/tall-spires-and-intricate-stone-carvings-_hQTCIk5.png','Tall spires and intricate stone carvings define the traditional Hindu temple architecture of Mahalakshmi Mandir.[6]','Tall spires and intricate stone carvings define the traditional Hindu temple architecture of Mahalakshmi Mandir.[6]','https://www.trawell.in/maharashtra/mumbai/mahalakshmi-temple'),(17669,'culture/images/maharashtra/mumbai/architecture/the-asiatic-society-is-an-example-of-neo-_RASEh0m.png','The Asiatic Society is an example of Neo-Classical architecture and features a Grecian portico.[7]','The Asiatic Society is an example of Neo-Classical architecture and features a Grecian portico.[7]','https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Asiatic_Society_of_Mumbai'),(17673,'culture/images/maharashtra/mumbai/architecture/moghul-manjis-twin-minarets-and-blue-tile_cA7FfDD.png','Moghul Manji’s twin minarets and blue-tiled facade reflect the elegance of Persian Shia architectural design.[8]','Moghul Manji’s twin minarets and blue-tiled facade reflect the elegance of Persian Shia architectural design.[8]','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moghal_Masjid,_Mumbai'),(17676,'culture/images/maharashtra/mumbai/architecture/esplanade-mansion-indias-oldest-cast-iron_8hAr89W.png','Esplanade Mansion, India’s oldest cast-iron building, showcases Victorian-era architecture.[9]','Esplanade Mansion, 