'),(20510,'culture/images/maharashtra/pune/architecture/main-entrance-with-a-metal-outer-door-and-w_mEPUGTP.jpg','Main entrance with a metal outer door and wooden inner door. (Source: CKA Archives)','Main entrance with a metal outer door and wooden inner door. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20512,'culture/images/maharashtra/pune/architecture/windows-with-a-chajja-for-shade-to-prevent-_CEeiJBo.jpg','Windows with a “chajja” for shade, to prevent rain from entering and reduce sky glare. (Source: CKA Archives)','Windows with a “chajja” for shade, to prevent rain from entering and reduce sky glare. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20513,'culture/images/maharashtra/pune/architecture/recessed-windows-with-outer-metal-grills-an_Mq9mAdX.jpg','Recessed windows with outer metal grills and sliding glass panels. (Source: CKA Archives)','Recessed windows with outer metal grills and sliding glass panels. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20515,'culture/images/maharashtra/pune/architecture/a-closer-view-of-the-residential-building-w_BOdHAPx.jpg','A closer view of the residential building which has an interesting modular color panel design. The building appears to use contrasting rectangular sections of white, dark green and light brown. (Source: CKA Archives)','A closer view of the residential building which has an interesting modular color panel design. The building appears to use contrasting rectangular sections of white, dark green and light brown. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20517,'culture/images/maharashtra/pune/architecture/densely-covered-garden-behind-phase-iv-with_GvBfcbk.jpg','Densely covered garden behind Phase IV with a variety of plants. (Source: CKA Archives)','Densely covered garden behind Phase IV with a variety of plants. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20518,'culture/images/maharashtra/pune/architecture/common-space-near-the-entry-to-the-resident_ESSZB2K.jpg','Common space near the entry to the residential society serving as a space for social interaction. (Source: CKA Archives)','Common space near the entry to the residential society serving as a space for social interaction. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20521,'culture/images/maharashtra/pune/architecture/entrance-to-kumar-panchsheel-through-the-bu_y7YJCSP.jpg','Entrance to Kumar Panchsheel through the bungalow society which sits amidst a relatively wide concrete road which leads to its residential buildings. (Source: CKA Archives)','Entrance to Kumar Panchsheel through the bungalow society which sits amidst a relatively wide concrete road which leads to its residential buildings. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20523,'culture/images/maharashtra/pune/architecture/internal-road-within-the-bungalow-society-l_iOb9OAS.jpg','Internal road within the bungalow society leading to the residential society which is maintained and under the purview of the community. (Source: CKA Archives)','Internal road within the bungalow society leading to the residential society which is maintained and under the purview of the community. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20524,'culture/images/maharashtra/pune/architecture/a-closer-view-of-the-residential-building-w_GRW2Tih.jpg','A closer view of the residential building which has a modular design featuring contrasting rectangular panels of cream, light brown and grey. (Source: CKA Archives)','A closer view of the residential building which has a modular design featuring contrasting rectangular panels of cream, light brown and grey. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20526,'culture/images/maharashtra/pune/architecture/a-recessed-polished-wood-door-fitted-with-s_nQPAx6y.jpg','A recessed, polished wood door fitted with steel attachment. (Source: CKA Archives)','A recessed, polished wood door fitted with steel attachment. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20528,'culture/images/maharashtra/pune/architecture/rectangular-window-featuring-sliding-glass-_cnkCS9q.jpg','Rectangular window featuring sliding glass shutters and metal grills. (Source: CKA Archives)','Rectangular window featurin