','Powdered aluminum window shutters with glass panes. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20541,'culture/images/maharashtra/pune/architecture/narrow-balcony-attached-to-the-living-room-_jKJTYjx.jpg','Narrow balcony attached to the living room of the apartment. The balcony has a wooden floor and a cluster of plants have been kept in it, leaving little space for outdoor seating. (Source: CKA Archives)','Narrow balcony attached to the living room of the apartment. The balcony has a wooden floor and a cluster of plants have been kept in it, leaving little space for outdoor seating. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20543,'culture/images/maharashtra/pune/architecture/vitrified-cream-colored-tiles-in-the-apartm_gofsbc1.jpg','Vitrified cream-colored tiles in the apartments with grout filling at the edges. (Source: CKA Archives)','Vitrified cream-colored tiles in the apartments with grout filling at the edges. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20570,'culture/images/maharashtra/pune/artforms/a-book-referencing-tritiya-ratna-a-pioneering-m_OU4oV7v.png','A book referencing \"Tritiya Ratna,\" a pioneering Marathi play by social reformer Jyotiba Phule, known for its early engagement with caste and social issues as part of a broader shift toward written drama in 19th-century Marathi theatre.[1]','A book referencing \"Tritiya Ratna,\" a pioneering Marathi play by social reformer Jyotiba Phule, known for its early engagement with caste and social issues as part of a broader shift toward written drama in 19th-century Marathi theatre.[1]','https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/36325750-tritiya-ratna'),(20572,'culture/images/maharashtra/pune/artforms/lalit-kala-kendra-established-in-1987-as-savitr_fEwvafu.png','Lalit Kala Kendra, established in 1987 as Savitribai Phule Pune University’s centre for full-time theatre education.[2]','Lalit Kala Kendra, established in 1987 as Savitribai Phule Pune University’s centre for full-time theatre education.[2]','https://hi.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E0%A4%B2%E0%A4%B2%E0%