-bhimsen-jos_5OS8IGO.png','The exterior of Bharat Ratna Pandit Bhimsen Joshi Kaladalan, Sahakarnagar area, Pune City.[7]','The exterior of Bharat Ratna Pandit Bhimsen Joshi Kaladalan, Sahakarnagar area, Pune City.[7]','https://www.pmc.gov.in/en/theater/theater-detail/pandit-bhimsen-joshi-kaladalan-sahakarnagar'),(20638,'culture/images/maharashtra/pune/artforms/exterior-view-of-lokshahir-annabhau-sathe-smara_b4KQlYu.jpg','Exterior view of Lokshahir Annabhau Sathe Smarak in Bibwewadi, Pune.[8]','Exterior view of Lokshahir Annabhau Sathe Smarak in Bibwewadi, Pune.[8]','https://www.justdial.com/Pune/Annabhau-Sathe-Smarak-Near-Swami-Vivekanand-Statue-Padmavati/020PXX20-XX20-140223124634-Z9C3_BZDET'),(20641,'culture/images/maharashtra/pune/artforms/exterior-view-of-gyaan-adab-a-cultural-centre-i_wrofYaF.jpg','Exterior view of Gyaan Adab, a cultural centre in Kalyani Nagar, Pune.[9]','Exterior view of Gyaan Adab, a cultural centre in Kalyani Nagar, Pune.[9]','https://www.gyaanadab.org/'),(20642,'culture/images/maharashtra/pune/artforms/a-visual-exhibition-inside-gyaan-adab10-1a36f276.jpg','A visual exhibition inside Gyaan Adab.[10]','A visual exhibition inside Gyaan Adab.[10]','https://www.gyaanadab.org/'),(20646,'culture/images/maharashtra/pune/artforms/exhibition-space-inside-monalisa-kalagram-koreg_ebhuvr5.jpg','Exhibition space inside Monalisa Kalagram, Koregaon Park, Pune City.[11]','Exhibition space inside Monalisa Kalagram, Koregaon Park, Pune City.[11]','https://monalisakalagram.com/?p=20507'),(20651,'culture/images/maharashtra/pune/artforms/actor-anupam-kher-with-pilf-founder-dr-manjiri-_f6UPF68.png','Actor Anupam Kher with PILF founder Dr. Manjiri Prabhu.[12]','Actor Anupam Kher with PILF founder Dr. Manjiri Prabhu.[12]','https://pilf.in/home-2023'),(20655,'culture/images/maharashtra/pune/artforms/an-aged-sawai-gandharva-center-with-a-young-bhi_ZUhtgvL.png','An aged Sawai Gandharva (center) with a young Bhimsen Joshi standing behind him.[13]','An aged Sawai Gandh