rst-floor balcony sits within a curved arch frame and has metal barriers. This shows how safety features can also be made attractive and match the overall style of the building. (Source: CKA Archives)','The first-floor balcony sits within a curved arch frame and has metal barriers. This shows how safety features can also be made attractive and match the overall style of the building. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20738,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/architecture/interior-staircase-with-decorative-wrough_MntQZ2s.jpg','Interior staircase with decorative wrought iron balusters connecting the home\'s multiple levels, combining structural necessity with ornamental metalwork. (Source: CKA Archives)','Interior staircase with decorative wrought iron balusters connecting the home\'s multiple levels, combining structural necessity with ornamental metalwork. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20739,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/architecture/close-up-of-the-iron-railing-at-the-stair_R0be6Zn.jpg','Close up of the iron railing at the staircase. (Source: CKA Archives)','Close up of the iron railing at the staircase. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20741,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/architecture/the-terrace-space-features-a-swing-and-po_9CFelC7.jpg','The terrace space features a swing and potted plants, forming a relaxed, semi-private space. (Source: CKA Archives)','The terrace space features a swing and potted plants, forming a relaxed, semi-private space. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20742,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/architecture/herbs-such-as-mint-chillies-and-curry-lea_1JCCy1M.jpg','Herbs such as mint, chillies, and curry leaves are grown in containers on the terrace, serving both culinary and practical needs, showcasing an efficient use of outdoor space in a dense urban setting. (Source: CKA Archives)','Herbs such as mint, chillies, and curry leaves are grown in containers on the terrace, serving both culinary and practical needs, showcasing an efficient use of outdoor space in a dense urban setting. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20746,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/architecture/the-amenities-are-situated-at-the-centre-_60fifUk.jpg','The amenities are situated at the centre of the residential complex and are visible from most apartments. (Source: CKA Archives)','The amenities are situated at the centre of the residential complex and are visible from most apartments. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20748,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/architecture/a-view-of-the-30-storey-residential-build_7dn3nkt.jpg','A view of the 30-storey residential building painted in neutral colors and rising to a non-human scale. (Source: CKA Archives)','A view of the 30-storey residential building painted in neutral colors and rising to a non-human scale. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20750,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/architecture/large-standing-window-in-the-living-room-_LELBx45.jpg','Large standing window in the living room with aluminum sliding frames and grills at the bottom. (Source: CKA Archives)','Large standing window in the living room with aluminum sliding frames and grills at the bottom. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20752,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/architecture/kitchen-with-granite-countertops-on-both-_AnG9Dkl.jpg','Kitchen with granite countertops on both sides and a glass door leading to a narrow balcony. (Source: CKA Archives)','Kitchen with granite countertops on both sides and a glass door leading to a narrow balcony. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20754,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/architecture/bathroom-with-tiled-walls-and-steel-fixtu_IUZqYSC.jpg','Bathroom with tiled walls and steel fixtures. The sink is set on a granite countertop. (Source: CKA Archives)','Bathroom with tiled walls and steel fixtures. The sink is set on a granite countertop. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20756,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/architecture/bedroom-with-a-large-aluminum-framed-wind_DO4NmYz.jpg','Bedroom with a large aluminum-framed window and wooden flooring. (Source: CKA Archives)','Bedroom with a large aluminum-framed window and wooden flooring. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20757,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/architecture/furnished-living-room-featuring-a-wooden-_vFGhu8N.jpg','Furnished living room featuring a wooden floor and contemporary interiors. (Source: CKA Archives)','Furnished living room featuring a wooden floor and contemporary interiors. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20773,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/artforms/traditional-toran-made-from-rice-stems-once-c_FTtfYv7.jpg','Traditional toran made from rice stems, once commonly crafted by women in Raigad district. (Source: CKA Archives)','Traditional toran made from rice stems, once commonly crafted by women in Raigad district. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20777,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/artforms/a-ganesh-murti-crafted-from-coconut-shells-by_OZogAUO.jpg','A Ganesh murti crafted from coconut shells by Rajendra Vani, a traditional artisan from Srivardhan taluka. (Source: CKA Archives)','A Ganesh murti crafted from coconut shells by Rajendra Vani, a traditional artisan from Srivardhan taluka. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20784,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/artforms/a-sculpture-displayed-at-karmarkar-museum-sas_OVYyKoZ.png','A sculpture displayed at Karmarkar Museum, Sasawane, Raigad district.[1]','A sculpture displayed at Karmarkar Museum, Sasawane, Raigad district.[1]','https://alibagtourism.com/things-to-do/karmarkar-museum/'),(20791,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/artforms/stage-performance-during-spectrum-cultural-fe_bKQHM0Z.png','Stage performance during Spectrum, cultural festival at NIFT Mumbai.[2]','Stage performance during Spectrum, cultural festival at NIFT Mumbai.[2]','https://www.nift.ac.in/mumbai/spectrum#:~:text=Spectrum%20is%20the%20annual%20cultural,%2C%20fashion%20shows%20and%20%2C%20iterature'),(20802,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/artforms/sand-painting-of-ganesha-created-by-veeresh-w_imdl5lH.jpg','Sand painting of Ganesha created by Veeresh Wani, incorporating 3D elements. (Source: CKA Archives)','Sand painting of Ganesha created by Veeresh Wani, incorporating 3D elements. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20803,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/artforms/lion-themed-sand-artwork-by-veeresh-wani-feat_xzRjYUx.jpg','Lion-themed sand artwork by Veeresh Wani, featuring detailed texture and color work. (Source: CKA Archives)','Lion-themed sand artwork by Veeresh Wani, featuring detailed texture and color work. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20816,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/cultural-sites/signboard-of-the-gram-panchayat-office-_1CYXYrt.jpg','Signboard of the Gram Panchayat office in Chandore, Raigad district. (Source: CKA Archives)','Signboard of the Gram Panchayat office in Chandore, Raigad district. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20817,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/cultural-sites/the-gram-panchayat-building-in-chandore_xewH80b.jpg','The Gram Panchayat building in Chandore, Raigad district which is the administrative seat of the village’s local governance, where the principle of binvirodh rajkaran (unopposed leadership) continues to be practiced. (Source: CKA Archives)','The Gram Panchayat building in Chandore, Raigad district which is the administrative seat of the village’s local governance, where the principle of binvirodh rajkaran (unopposed leadership) continues to be practiced. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20819,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/cultural-sites/archaeological-remains-found-in-chandor_hPvADJ4.jpg','Archaeological remains found in Chandore village, including veergals, shivling, coins, and terracotta fragments, suggest its historical role as both a commemorative site and a point along trade routes. (Source: CKA Archives)','Archaeological remains found in Chandore village, including veergals, shivling, coins, and terracotta fragments, suggest its historical role as both a commemorative site and a point along trade routes. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20820,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/cultural-sites/veergals-in-chandore-raigad-commemorati_pco4jw1.jpg','Veergals in Chandore, Raigad commemorating fallen warriors, believed by locals to reflect the village’s martial legacy. (Source: CKA Archives)','Veergals in Chandore, Raigad commemorating fallen warriors, believed by locals to reflect the village’s martial legacy. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20824,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/cultural-sites/an-archival-image-of-the-chavdar-lake-a_FYx5CYZ.jpg','An archival image of the Chavdar Lake at Mahad, Raigad, which was site of the 1927 Satyagraha led by Dr. B.R. Ambedkar to assert the rights of Dalits to access public water sources.[1]','An archival image of the Chavdar Lake at Mahad, Raigad, which was site of the 1927 Satyagraha led by Dr. B.R. Ambedkar to assert the rights of Dalits to access public water sources.[1]','https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9c/Chavdar_Tale_%28tank%29_at_Mahad_%28Raigad%2C_Maharashtra%29._Dr._Ambedkar_had_led_the_epic_struggle_of_the_Untouchables_here_by_symbolically_drinking_its_water.jpg?20170710213027'),(20828,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/cultural-sites/ganpati-of-the-chirner-ganpati-mandir-u_zFfQxsq.jpg','Ganpati of the Chirner Ganpati Mandir, Uran taluka, Raigad district. (Source: CKA Archives)','Ganpati of the Chirner Ganpati Mandir, Uran taluka, Raigad district. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20832,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/cultural-sites/smruti-stambh-rebuilt-in-1939-commemora_ZRxBvXz.jpg','Smruti Stambh rebuilt in 1939, commemorating the Satyagrahis of Chirner. (Source: CKA Archives)','Smruti Stambh rebuilt in 1939, commemorating the Satyagrahis of Chirner. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20833,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/cultural-sites/statues-commemorating-the-satyagrahis-k_MRgd8qu.jpg','Statues commemorating the Satyagrahis killed during the 1930 Jungle Satyagraha in Chirner village, Uran taluka, Raigad district. (Source: CKA Archives)','Statues commemorating the Satyagrahis killed during the 1930 Jungle Satyagraha in Chirner village, Uran taluka, Raigad district. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20835,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/cultural-sites/preserved-remnants-of-the-original-1932_DoSPpPq.jpg','Preserved remnants of the original 1932 memorial in Chirner, Raigad destroyed by British forces. (Source: CKA Archives)','Preserved remnants of the original 1932 memorial in Chirner, Raigad destroyed by British forces. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20839,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/cultural-sites/a-standing-murti-of-vitthal-beside-the-_csmNXzV.jpg','A standing murti of Vitthal beside the main Mandir in Dhanegav, Karjat, Raigad. (Source: CKA Archives)','A standing murti of Vitthal beside the main Mandir in Dhanegav, Karjat, Raigad. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20843,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/cultural-sites/the-main-entrance-to-a-cave-at-elephant_sxruJFO.png','The main entrance to a cave at Elephanta, Raigad district, carved directly into basalt rock. (Source: CKA Archives)','The main entrance to a cave at Elephanta, Raigad district, carved directly into basalt rock. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20852,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/cultural-sites/the-caves-of-gharapuri-raigad-district-_RNuFCGC.png','The caves of Gharapuri, Raigad district are adorned with numerous carvings of Shiv. A distinctive feature of these caves is that they were carved from a single rock, starting from the top and working downwards. Among the many attractions is the impressive statue of Brahma-Vishnu-Mahesh. (Source: CKA Archives)','The caves of Gharapuri, Raigad district are adorned with numerous carvings of Shiv. A distinctive feature of these caves is that they were carved from a single rock, starting from the top and working downwards. Among the many attractions is the impressive statue of Brahma-Vishnu-Mahesh. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20856,'culture/images/maharashtra/raigad/cultur