 in Walaval. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22690,'culture/images/maharashtra/sindhudurg/cultural-sites/the-exterior-of-pokharbav-siddhivin_rCFHAsM.jpg','The exterior of Pokharbav Siddhivinayak Ganpati Mandir, Dabhole, Sindhudurg district(Source: CKA Archives)','The exterior of Pokharbav Siddhivinayak Ganpati Mandir, Dabhole, Sindhudurg district(Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22692,'culture/images/maharashtra/sindhudurg/cultural-sites/the-unique-representation-of-shri-g_4Lu7kDY.jpg','The unique representation of Shri Ganesh in the Mandir, Dabhole, Sindhudurg district(Source: CKA Archives)','The unique representation of Shri Ganesh in the Mandir, Dabhole, Sindhudurg district(Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22694,'culture/images/maharashtra/sindhudurg/cultural-sites/the-swayambhu-panchmukhi-shivling-b_kZbrnCN.jpg','The swayambhu Panchmukhi Shivling beneath the Mandir, Dabhole, Sindhudurg district(Source: CKA Archives)','The swayambhu Panchmukhi Shivling beneath the Mandir, Dabhole, Sindhudurg district(Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22697,'culture/images/maharashtra/sindhudurg/cultural-sites/exterior-view-of-redi-ganapati-mand_zjzzy1n.jpg','Exterior view of Redi Ganapati Mandir, Redi, Sindhudurg district.(Source: CKA Archives)','Exterior view of Redi Ganapati Mandir, Redi, Sindhudurg district.(Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22698,'culture/images/maharashtra/sindhudurg/cultural-sites/the-legend-of-the-murti-displayed-a_sRUwQLM.jpg','The legend of the murti displayed at the Mandir, Redi, Sindhudurg district. It says that a man from Nagolewadi had a dream in which Shri Ganesh appeared and revealed the location of a buried murti. When villagers excavated the site, they found the Ganesh murti exactly as described in the dream. (Source: CKA Archives)','The legend of the murti displayed at the Mandir, Redi, Sindhudurg district. It says that a man from Nagolewadi had a dream in which Shri Ganesh appeared and revealed the location of a buried murti. When villagers excavated the site, they fou