ives)','The walls of the entrance are painted with colorful murals. Interestingly, the word ‘Vivaah’ (marriage) has been inscribedon the wall. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22951,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/wooden-main-entrance-door-it-is-said-tha_xm05Q3H.png','Wooden main entrance door. It is said that the ‘Swastika’ painted on the door is an auspicious symbol. The door uses a chain and padlock system for protection. (Source: CKA Archives)','Wooden main entrance door. It is said that the ‘Swastika’ painted on the door is an auspicious symbol. The door uses a chain and padlock system for protection. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22952,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/iron-spikes-adorning-the-main-door-for-p_yQLBs2B.png','Iron spikes adorning the main door for protection. Interestingly, instead of using a traditional design, decorative flowers have been added to add a decorative element. (Source: CKA Archives)','Iron spikes adorning the main door for protection. Interestingly, instead of using a traditional design, decorative flowers have been added to add a decorative element. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22953,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/the-chowkhat-of-the-main-entrance-door-a_Rzb6kwT.png','The chowkhat of the main entrance door, adorned with motifs of flowers and leaves. The Chowkhat is painted red, which is considered an auspicious colour. (Source: CKA Archives)','The chowkhat of the main entrance door, adorned with motifs of flowers and leaves. The Chowkhat is painted red, which is considered an auspicious colour. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22955,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/internal-wooden-door-of-the-residence-pa_g9w9ADR.png','Internal wooden door of the residence, painted a solid neutral color and secured with a chain and padlock. (Source: CKA Archives)','Internal wooden door of the residence, painted a solid neutral color and secured with a chain and padlock. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22956,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/bright-green-wooden-door-on-the-inside-o_ks5W6li.png','Bright green wooden door on the inside of the house secured with a latch bolt. (Source: CKA Archives)','Bright green wooden door on the inside of the house secured with a latch bolt. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22958,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/the-window-is-painted-a-bright-green-col_iMB1am2.png','The window is painted a bright green color and has intricate floral grills. The Chajja seems to be constructed out of metal sheets and a wooden structure. (Source: CKA Archives)','The window is painted a bright green color and has intricate floral grills. The Chajja seems to be constructed out of metal sheets and a wooden structure. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22961,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/a-distinctive-yellow-colored-house-with-_Utfgarm.jpg','A distinctive yellow-colored house with murals painted inside. (Source: CKA Archives)','A distinctive yellow-colored house with murals painted inside. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22963,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/view-of-the-madhala-maruti-galli-notice-_134jSO7.jpg','View of the Madhala Maruti Galli. Notice the Mandir at the entrance of the street. (Source: CKA Archives)','View of the Madhala Maruti Galli. Notice the Mandir at the entrance of the street. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22965,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/entrance-of-the-house-with-murals-painte_W4b40Js.jpg','Entrance of the house with murals painted on the passageway. (Source: CKA Archives)','Entrance of the house with murals painted on the passageway. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22967,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/interestingly-the-door-is-painted-purple_Wl0YW4X.jpg','Interestingly, the door is painted purple, providing a beautiful contrast to the yellow wall. The wall features murals of guards. (Source: CKA Archives)','Interestingly, the door i