he interior of the roof constructed using soil and wood. Cloth was used to cover it and prevent soil from falling down. Notice the beautiful skylight allowing sunlight to illuminate the house. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22976,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/courtyard-of-the-house-where-various-fun_0aX60UP.jpg','Courtyard of the house where various functions of the house are carried out. Notice the traditional way of drying red chillies. (Source: CKA Archives)','Courtyard of the house where various functions of the house are carried out. Notice the traditional way of drying red chillies. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22977,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/an-extension-to-the-courtyard-featuring-_CKxgNlc.jpg','An extension to the courtyard featuring a seating area. Notice the colourful murals of Bhagwan Ganpati and a ‘kalash’ painted on the walls. Notice the pictures of Gajanan Maharaj hung on the wall. (Source: CKA Archives)','An extension to the courtyard featuring a seating area. Notice the colourful murals of Bhagwan Ganpati and a ‘kalash’ painted on the walls. Notice the pictures of Gajanan Maharaj hung on the wall. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22979,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/wooden-column-with-a-green-painting-on-i_oMlN36S.jpg','Wooden column with a green painting on it. It is believed to be a common feature of Wadas, which has been brought over to modern constructions. (Source: CKA Archives)','Wooden column with a green painting on it. It is believed to be a common feature of Wadas, which has been brought over to modern constructions. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22981,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/storage-spaces-with-wooden-panels-intere_PcUOCkL.jpg','Storage spaces with wooden panels. Interestingly, a picture of Bhagwan Ganesh is on the panel. Valuable items could be stored inside. Notice the auspicious ‘Shree’ written above and the floral border. (Source: CKA Archives)','Storage spaces with wooden panels. Interestingly, a picture of Bhagwan Ganesh is on the panel. Valuable items could be stored inside. Notice the auspicious ‘Shree’ written above and the floral border. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22982,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/an-open-storage-space-used-to-store-ever_YlnO7op.jpg','An open storage space used to store everyday items and decorated using floral murals on the wall. (Source: CKA Archives)','An open storage space used to store everyday items and decorated using floral murals on the wall. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22984,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/devghar-holding-paintings-of-different-d_RYbGjaf.jpg','Devghar holding paintings of different devtas. The residents seem to primarily worship Datta Bhagwan, also known as Trimurti. Notice the traditional rangoli drawn at the bottom. The Devghar also features written Shlokas worshipping Devi Lakshmi - a Devi primarily associated with prosperity. (Source: CKA Archives)','Devghar holding paintings of different devtas. The residents seem to primarily worship Datta Bhagwan, also known as Trimurti. Notice the traditional rangoli drawn at the bottom. The Devghar also features written Shlokas worshipping Devi Lakshmi - a Devi primarily associated with prosperity. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22987,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/the-building-has-commercial-shops-on-the_o8laX9L.jpg','The building has commercial shops on the bottom storey, while the upper storeys serve as private residences. Notice the arches at the top, which add a distinct architectural element to the building. (Source: CKA Archives)','The building has commercial shops on the bottom storey, while the upper storeys serve as private residences. Notice the arches at the top, which add a distinct architectural element to the building. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22989,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/congested-entrance-of-the-residence-such_dydlIMV.jpg','Congested entrance of the residence. Such parking arrangements are said to be common across buildings, where limited space and a high number of personal vehicles lead to congestion. (Source: CKA Archives)','Congested entrance of the residence. Such parking arrangements are said to be common across buildings, where limited space and a high number of personal vehicles lead to congestion. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22991,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/congested-entrance-of-the-residence-such_z3pWCqE.jpg','Congested entrance of the residence. Such parking arrangements are said to be common across buildings, where limited space and a high number of personal vehicles lead to congestion. (Source: CKA Archives)','Congested entrance of the residence. Such parking arrangements are said to be common across buildings, where limited space and a high number of personal vehicles lead to congestion. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22993,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/the-recessed-windows-of-the-apartment-bu_dJDpoMN.jpg','The recessed windows of the Apartment building. (Source: CKA Archives)','The recessed windows of the Apartment building. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22996,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/a-neutral-toned-residential-building-tha_1NcIGAb.jpg','A neutral-toned residential building that serves as a prominent local landmark. (Source: CKA Archives)','A neutral-toned residential building that serves as a prominent local landmark. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(22998,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/windows-with-aluminum-shutters-ms-grill-_nkcsrxB.jpg','Windows with aluminum shutters, MS grill, and RCC chajja. (Source: CKA Archives)','Windows with aluminum shutters, MS grill, and RCC chajja. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(23000,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/notice-the-interesting-visuals-created-b_vxyCHpE.jpg','Notice the interesting visuals created by the staggered placement of the balconies, allowing for extra headroom. (Source: CKA Archives)','Notice the interesting visuals created by the staggered placement of the balconies, allowing for extra headroom. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(23001,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/architecture/balcony-of-the-house-overlooking-the-str_Dob86Ti.jpg','Balcony of the house overlooking the street with a stub-parapet wall and MS railings. (Source: CKA Archives)','Balcony of the house overlooking the street with a stub-parapet wall and MS railings. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(23010,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/artforms/members-of-the-dhangar-community-performing-_rhSiFsB.jpg','Members of the Dhangar community performing Dhangari Gaja, a folk dance form known for its energetic drumming and storytelling elements.[1]','Members of the Dhangar community performing Dhangari Gaja, a folk dance form known for its energetic drumming and storytelling elements.[1]','https://x.com/SCZCC/status/1404693503951638530'),(23014,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/artforms/lezim-dancers-in-traditional-attire-showcasi_27zxM8B.png','Lezim dancers in traditional attire showcasing synchronized steps and vibrant formations during a cultural event.[2]','Lezim dancers in traditional attire showcasing synchronized steps and vibrant formations during a cultural event.[2]','https://puneridhol.weebly.com/uploads/5/1/9/5/51956635/9325744_orig.jpg'),(23021,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/artforms/a-collection-of-solapuri-chaddars-on-display_QLaZ696.jpg','A collection of Solapuri chaddars on display, woven by local artisans, known for its vibrant patterns and fine cotton weave.[3]','A collection of Solapuri chaddars on display, woven by local artisans, known for its vibrant patterns and fine cotton weave.[3]','https://kironindia.com/B083YY76ZX/'),(23025,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/artforms/close-up-of-banjara-embroidery-highlighting-_npTZPSR.png','Close-up of Banjara embroidery, highlighting the detailed mirror work, beadwork, 