 storage pits found at Narkhed, Solapur.[8]','Underground storage pits found at Narkhed, Solapur.[8]','https://www.indiatoday.in/india-today-insight/story/when-archaeologists-found-pre-historic-era-storage-pits-in-maharashtras-solapur-2477549-2023-12-18'),(23096,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/cultural-sites/the-murti-of-shri-ganesh-in-the-ganesh_kGozDxa.png','The murti of Shri Ganesh in the Ganesh Panchayatan Mandir at Akkalkot. (Source: CKA Archives)','The murti of Shri Ganesh in the Ganesh Panchayatan Mandir at Akkalkot. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(23098,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/cultural-sites/the-padukas-gifted-to-the-maharaj-of-a_YctF8Q5.jpg','The Padukas gifted to the Maharaj of Akkalkot are placed in the Ganesh Panchayatan Mandir. (Source: CKA Archives)','The Padukas gifted to the Maharaj of Akkalkot are placed in the Ganesh Panchayatan Mandir. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(23101,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/cultural-sites/the-sri-guru-nanak-darbar-in-antrolika_ZTeN5SY.png','The Sri Guru Nanak Darbar in Antrolikar Nagar, Solapur. (Source: CKA Archives)','The Sri Guru Nanak Darbar in Antrolikar Nagar, Solapur. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(23105,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/cultural-sites/view-of-the-kamala-bhavani-mandir-in-k_PhsXsaM.png','View of the Kamala Bhavani Mandir in Karmala, Solapur.[9]','View of the Kamala Bhavani Mandir in Karmala, Solapur.[9]','https://solapur.gov.in/en/tourist-place/karmala/'),(23106,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/cultural-sites/the-96-steps-leading-to-the-entrance-o_67rxgPI.png','The 96 steps leading to the entrance of the Kamala Bhavani Mandir at Karnala. (Source: CKA Archives)','The 96 steps leading to the entrance of the Kamala Bhavani Mandir at Karnala. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(23108,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/cultural-sites/the-main-murti-of-the-kamala-bhavani-m_uMHcZTs.png','The main murti of the Kamala Bhavani Mandir. (Source: CKA Archives)','The main murti of the Kamala Bhavani Mandir. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(23111,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/cultural-sites/the-murti-at-the-nagnath-mandir-wadwal_L0axlr2.jpg','The murti at the Nagnath Mandir, Wadwal, Solapur.[10]','The murti at the Nagnath Mandir, Wadwal, Solapur.[10]','https://marathi.abplive.com/news/gramdevta-vadval-nagnath-story-308759'),(23115,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/cultural-sites/a-picture-of-shankarrao-rajeray-on-the_2CWP95n.png','A picture of Shankarrao Rajeray on the premises of the Rajeray Math at Akkalkot, Solapur (Source: CKA Archives)','A picture of Shankarrao Rajeray on the premises of the Rajeray Math at Akkalkot, Solapur (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(23117,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/cultural-sites/the-footprint-of-shri-swami-samarth-at_z7VRfO8.png','The footprint of Shri Swami Samarth at the Rajeray Math. (Source: CKA Archives)','The footprint of Shri Swami Samarth at the Rajeray Math. (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(23120,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/cultural-sites/the-roop-bhavani-devi-mandir-in-bhavan_FQzzOMN.jpg','The Roop Bhavani Devi Mandir in Bhavani Peth, Solapur (Source: CKA Archives)','The Roop Bhavani Devi Mandir in Bhavani Peth, Solapur (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(23124,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/cultural-sites/the-siddheshwar-mandir-at-machnur-vill_6J86FGC.jpg','The Siddheshwar Mandir at Machnur village, Mangalvedhe taluka.[11]','The Siddheshwar Mandir at Machnur village, Mangalvedhe taluka.[11]','https://in.pinterest.com/pin/914371530564386536/'),(23126,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/cultural-sites/the-ruins-of-machnur-fort-in-machnur-m_pNovpQD.png','The ruins of Machnur Fort in Machnur, Mangalvedhe taluka, Solapur district.[12]','The ruins of Machnur Fort in Machnur, Mangalvedhe taluka, Solapur district.[12]','https://www.fortsmaharashtra.com/machnur-fort/'),(23130,'culture/images/maharashtra/solapur/cultural-sites/lake-within-the-siddheshwar-mandir-com_6Lg48SV.png','Lake within the Siddheshwar Mandir co