d in an election and win.','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aaditya_Thackeray#/media/File:Shri_Aaditya_Thackeray_-_2020_(cropped).jpg'),(25868,'culture/images/maharashtra/mumbai-suburban/local-politics/aaditya-is-the-first-member-of_cMi1s2I.png','Aaditya is the first member of the Thackeray Family to stand in an election and win.','Aaditya is the first member of the Thackeray Family to stand in an election and win.','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aaditya_Thackeray#/media/File:Shri_Aaditya_Thackeray_-_2020_(cropped).jpg'),(25869,'culture/images/maharashtra/mumbai-suburban/local-politics/aaditya-is-the-first-member-of_OpJaAvO.png','Aaditya is the first member of the Thackeray Family to stand in an election and win.','Aaditya is the first member of the Thackeray Family to stand in an election and win.','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aaditya_Thackeray#/media/File:Shri_Aaditya_Thackeray_-_2020_(cropped).jpg'),(25921,'culture/images/maharashtra/mumbai-suburban/local-politics/aaditya-is-the-first-member-of_fS8PE6X.jpg','Aaditya is the first member of the Thackeray Family to stand in an election and win.','Aaditya is the first member of the Thackeray Family to stand in an election and win.','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aaditya_Thackeray#/media/File:Shri_Aaditya_Thackeray_-_2020_(cropped).jpg'),(25924,'culture/images/maharashtra/mumbai-suburban/local-politics/uddhav-balasaheb-thackeray-1df6adbd.jpg','Uddhav Balasaheb Thackeray','Uddhav Balasaheb Thackeray','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uddhav_Thackeray#/media/File:The_Chief_Minister_of_Maharashtra,_Shri_Uddhav_Thackeray_calling_on_the_Prime_Minister,_Shri_Narendra_Modi,_in_New_Delhi_on_February_21,_2020_(Uddhav_Thackeray)_(cropped).jpg'),(25943,'culture/images/maharashtra/nagpur/local-politics/devendra-fadnavis-has-served-as-the-chi_jYM6T70.png','Devendra Fadnavis has served as the Chief Minister of Maharashtra for three terms.','Devendra Fadnavis has served as the Chief Minister of Maharashtra for three terms.','https://ww