ass=\"c0\"><span class=\"c1\">Yogesh Sagar</span></p></td><td class=\"c3\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p class=\"c0\"><span class=\"c1\">Charkop</span></p></td><td class=\"c3\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p class=\"c0\"><span class=\"c1\">BJP</span></p></td></tr><tr class=\"c10\"><td class=\"c3\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p class=\"c0\"><span class=\"c1\">Aslam Shaikh</span></p></td><td class=\"c3\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p class=\"c0\"><span class=\"c1\">Malad West</span></p></td><td class=\"c3\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p class=\"c0\"><span class=\"c1\">INC</span></p></td></tr><tr class=\"c10\"><td class=\"c3\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p class=\"c0\"><span class=\"c1\">Vidya Thakur</span></p></td><td class=\"c3\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p class=\"c0\"><span class=\"c1\">Goregaon</span></p></td><td class=\"c3\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p class=\"c0\"><span class=\"c1\">BJP</span></p></td></tr><tr class=\"c10\"><td class=\"c3\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p class=\"c0\"><span class=\"c1\">Haroon Khan</span></p></td><td class=\"c3\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p class=\"c0\"><span class=\"c1\">Versova</span></p></td><td class=\"c3\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p class=\"c0\"><span class=\"c1\">SHS (UBT)</span></p></td></tr><tr class=\"c10\"><td class=\"c3\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p class=\"c0\"><span class=\"c1\">Ameet Bhaskar Satam</span></p></td><td class=\"c3\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p class=\"c0\"><span class=\"c1\">Andheri West</span></p></td><td class=\"c3\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p class=\"c0\"><span class=\"c1\">BJP</span></p></td></tr><tr class=\"c10\"><td class=\"c3\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p class=\"c0\"><span class=\"c1\">Murji Patel</span></p></td><td class=\"c3\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p class=\"c0\"><span class=\"c1\">Andheri East</span></p></td><td class=\"c3\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p class=\"c0\"><span class=\"c1\">SHS</span></p></td></tr><tr class=\"c10\"><td class=\"c3\" colspan=\"