age in small businesses, such as selling juices from carts (Source: CKA Archives).','Seasonal employment in Akola, as described by locals, varies significantly with the changing seasons. During the summer months, many individuals engage in small businesses, such as selling juices from carts (Source: CKA Archives).',''),(20113,'statistic/images/maharashtra/akola/labour/one-prominent-institution-is-the-government-in_HElLqvs.png','One prominent institution is the Government Industrial Training Institute (ITI) for Women, established in 1992. This institute focuses on providing vocational training tailored to women\'s needs, helping them acquire skills that enhance their employability and entrepreneurial potential.','One prominent institution is the Government Industrial Training Institute (ITI) for Women, established in 1992. This institute focuses on providing vocational training tailored to women\'s needs, helping them acquire skills that enhance their employability and entrepreneurial potential.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IaCWp9FyxF8'),(20134,'statistic/images/maharashtra/amravati/labour/the-regional-directorate-of-technical-educa_BNRWdoP.png','The Regional Directorate of Technical Education in Amravati strives to develop world-class, globally competitive, and adaptable higher education institutions that respond to the developmental needs of Maharashtra and India.','The Regional Directorate of Technical Education in Amravati strives to develop world-class, globally competitive, and adaptable higher education institutions that respond to the developmental needs of Maharashtra and India.','https://www.jdroamt.org/'),(20135,'statistic/images/maharashtra/amravati/labour/this-vision-is-pursued-through-several-key-_KpNFeCB.png','This vision is pursued through several key objectives: elevating the quality of technical education to meet international standards, implementing efficient and transparent management systems, producing skilled technical professionals to meet industry demands and support economic growth, and strengthening research capabilities within the education system. Through these interconnected goals, the directorate aims to create a robust technical education framework that serves both individual and institutional needs while contributing to broader social development.','This vision is pursued through several key objectives: elevating the quality of technical education to meet international standards, implementing efficient and transparent management systems, producing skilled technical professionals to meet industry demands and support economic growth, and strengthening research capabilities within the education system. Through these interconnected goals, the directorate aims to create a robust technical education framework that serves both individual and institutional needs while contributing to broader social development.','https://www.jdroamt.org/'),(20160,'statistic/images/maharashtra/beed/labour/established-in-1983-this-institute-is-recognize_oxhYXJ2.png','Established in 1983, this institute is recognized as a leading government polytechnic in the region, offering diploma courses in various technical disciplines. It aims to provide quality education and skill development to students, preparing them for the workforce.','Established in 1983, this institute is recognized as a leading government polytechnic in the region, offering diploma courses in various technical disciplines. It aims to provide quality education and skill development to students, preparing them for the workforce.','http://www.gpbeed.ac.in/'),(20163,'statistic/images/maharashtra/beed/labour/operated-by-aditya-bahuddeshiya-sanstha-this-in_mm6Nw4K.png','Operated by Aditya Bahuddeshiya Sanstha, this institution offers a range of technical courses and is located on Telgaon Road, Beed. It focuses on providing practical and theoretical knowledge to its students.','Operated by Aditya Bahuddeshiya Sanstha, this institution offers a range of technical courses and is located on Telgaon Road, Beed. It focuses on providing practical and theoretical knowledge to its students.','https://www.justdial.com/Beed/Aditya-Engineering-College-Near-Sarda-Estate-Nalwandi-Naka-Mominpura/9999P2442-2442-180820235815-Y1T7_BZDET'),(20194,'statistic/images/maharashtra/bhandara/labour/image-no-caption-14af7f8f.jpg','Image (no caption)','Image (no caption)',''),(20347,'statistic/images/maharashtra/dharashiv/labour/a-vendor-sells-onions-on-the-streets-of-dh_SL2cQaN.png','A vendor sells onions on the streets of Dharashiv (Source: CKA Archives)','A vendor sells onions on the streets of Dharashiv (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20351,'statistic/images/maharashtra/dharashiv/labour/vehicles-carrying-goods-and-men-in-bhum-so_GYRvsiy.png','Vehicles carrying goods and men in Bhum (Source: CKA Archives)','Vehicles carrying goods and men in Bhum (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20353,'statistic/images/maharashtra/dharashiv/labour/a-shepherd-grazes-goats-in-umarga-source-c_XgtKY1m.png','A shepherd grazes goats in Umarga (Source: CKA Archives)','A shepherd grazes goats in Umarga (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(20355,'statistic/images/maharashtra/dharashiv/labour/women-working-on-the-sugarcane-fields-in-d_fKUCevY.png','Women working on the sugarcane fields in Dharashiv (Source: CKA Archives)','Women working on the sugarcane fields in Dharashiv (Source: CKA Archives)',''),(21758,'statistic/images/maharashtra/ahilyanagar/environment/the-western-part-of-the-district-is_f6WcOYv.png','The western part of the district is dominated by the Sahyadri mountain ranges, which include notable peaks such as Kalsubai (as seen above), the highest point at 5,427 feet, along with Harishchandragad and Baleshwar.','The western part of the district is dominated by the Sahyadri mountain ranges, which include notable peaks such as Kalsubai (as seen above), the highest point at 5,427 feet, along with Harishchandragad and Baleshwar.','https://indiahikes.com/documented-trek/kalsubai-