, formerly known as Borivali National Park and Krishnagiri National Park, represents a unique protected area within the Mumbai metropolitan region. Located partially in Thane district, it covers an area of approximately 87 square kilometers. Its status as one of the world\'s largest national parks within city limits makes it particularly significant for urban biodiversity conservation.','The Sanjay Gandhi National Park (SGNP), formerly known as Borivali National Park and Krishnagiri National Park, represents a unique protected area within the Mumbai metropolitan region. Located partially in Thane district, it covers an area of approximately 87 square kilometers. Its status as one of the world\'s largest national parks within city limits makes it particularly significant for urban biodiversity conservation.','https://bragpacker.com/sanjay-gandhi-national-park/'),(23842,'statistic/images/maharashtra/thane/environment/tansa-wildlife-sanctuary-established-in-1_UIoOZVR.png','Tansa Wildlife Sanctuary, established in 1970, is located around the Tansa lake reservoir and covers approximately 304.81 square kilometers in Thane district. The sanctuary derives its name from the Tansa River and the reservoir that serves as a major water source for Mumbai.','Tansa Wildlife Sanctuary, established in 1970, is located around the Tansa lake reservoir and covers approximately 304.81 square kilometers in Thane district. The sanctuary derives its name from the Tansa River and the reservoir that serves as a major water source for Mumbai.','https://www.thrillophilia.com/attractions/tansa-wildlife-sanctuary'),(23845,'statistic/images/maharashtra/thane/environment/tungareshwar-wildlife-sanctuary-establish_09V8RR7.png','Tungareshwar Wildlife Sanctuary, established in 2003, covers an area of approximately 85.70 square kilometers in Thane district. The sanctuary connects Sanjay Gandhi National Park (SGNP) with other forest patches, serving as a vital wildlife corridor in an increasingly urbanized landscape.','Tungareshwar Wildlife Sanctuary, established in 2003, covers an area of approximately 85.70 square kilometers in Thane district. The sanctuary connects Sanjay Gandhi National Park (SGNP) with other forest patches, serving as a vital wildlife corridor in an increasingly urbanized landscape.','https://www.tripadvisor.in/Attraction_Review-g1982926-d9709870-Reviews-Tungareshwar_Wildlife_Sanctuary-Vasai_Palghar_District_Maharashtra.html'),(23848,'statistic/images/maharashtra/thane/environment/image-no-caption-31a2fd3f.png','Image (no caption)','Image (no caption)',''),(23899,'statistic/images/maharashtra/wardha/environment/image-no-caption-f6e9311c.jpg','Image (no caption)','Image (no caption)',''),(23901,'statistic/images/maharashtra/wardha/environment/image-no-caption-1e95de40.png','Image (no caption)','Image (no caption)',''),(23904,'statistic/images/maharashtra/wardha/environment/image-no-caption-0fe518a7.png','Image (no caption)','Image (no caption)',''),(23907,'statistic/images/maharashtra/wardha/environment/image-no-caption-09410bf2.png','Image (no caption)','Image (no caption)',''),(23912,'statistic/images/maharashtra/wardha/environment/image-no-caption-184c0938.png','Image (no caption)','Image (no caption)',''),(23926,'statistic/images/maharashtra/wardha/environment/image-no-caption-9d0e075b.png','Image (no caption)','Image (no caption)',''),(23957,'statistic/images/maharashtra/washim/environment/image-no-caption-6f6627ec.jpg','Image (no caption)','Image (no caption)',''),(23959,'statistic/images/maharashtra/washim/environment/image-no-caption-a8a1b39f.png','Image (no caption)','Image (no caption)',''),(23962,'statistic/images/maharashtra/washim/environment/image-no-caption-d556de14.png','Image (no caption)','Image (no caption)',''),(23965,'statistic/images/maharashtra/washim/environment/image-no-caption-4f7d0ec2.png','Image (no caption)','Image (no caption)',''),(23970,'statistic/images/maharashtra/washim/environment/image-no-caption-fc6fc418.pn